Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失者 必重现\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappears, reappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,四骑士 四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horsemen! Horsemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,四骑士 四骑士 四骑士 四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horsemen! Horsemen!Horsemen! Horsemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我们弃场了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think we abandoned you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是魔术技穷了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that we'd run out of magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:00:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想 女士先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, think again, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好大开眼界吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you are about to be amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然各位在场 说明你们已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're here right now, then you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,循踪破译 解开了谜题\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed the clues and cracked the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 欢迎入局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an6\i0\fad（2000，0）}纽约市 - 布什维克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,阔别十年后 四骑士现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been 10 years since the horseman last appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,正式回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we are back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 凑近点 再近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, come in close.Mm, closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你自以为看清的越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the more you think you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.02,0:01:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越容易被旧瓶装新酒的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}the easier it will be to dress up old tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙骗过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fool you that they are new.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 J·丹尼尔·阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my name is J. Daniel Atlas,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我代表这几位魅力稍逊的同僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and allow me to speak as I often do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说一句…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my less charismatic colleagues when I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼 回归的感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! It is very good to be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们要么隐匿一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.We vanished for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在魔法界\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in the world of magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡消失者 必重现\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that disappears, reappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要戏法玩得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least if the trick is done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是梅里特·麦金尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Merritt McKinney.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像我的好哥们丹尼那么自恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike my, uh, very good buddy here, Danny,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.42,0:02:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚入场的各位都挺谦虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of you checked your egos at the door tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们摸进这场地下盛会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found this little underground soiree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想来“受骗”的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you wanted to get fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 我是杰克·怀尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everyone. I'm Jack Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争 瘟疫 气候剧变 AI\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wars, pandemics, climate change, AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 此刻我们更需要魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's face it, we all need magic more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以请睁大眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want you to pay very close attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.45,0:02:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的戏法不容错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not gonna want to miss this next trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·里维斯 现在冠了夫姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henley Reeves, now Henley Reeves Stanley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,三娃两狗 硕士在手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three kids, two dogs and a master's degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,久违了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当年确实挺牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys were great back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也想当魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to want to be a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我过了中二年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I turned 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:03:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 隔墙有耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, they might be listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟 我吓得直发抖呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, I'm shaking in my AllSaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能拿我怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真金的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that real gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.38,0:03:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥？ - 手机是真金的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Is that real gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然 爷有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是魔术秀 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a magic show, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的人不是扒手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every fool here is a pickpocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是肥羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a pickpocket's fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚那是俳句吗？ - 什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was that a haiku? - What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位手里都有一张牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of you just received a playing card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意的话 请亮出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wouldn't mind, uh, pulling it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在来大洗牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Now, we're gonna shuffle the deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便找个身边人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so everybody find a random person near them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他交换卡牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and switch cards with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,换完之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when you've done that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再找别人换一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}find somebody else and switch with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great. Uh, now…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个谁 就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, duh-duh-duh-duh-duh…You there, down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？ - 对 你的牌是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Yeah. What is your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 方片A - 方片A 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ace of diamonds. - Ace of diamonds. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让事情复杂点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make things a little more complicated here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有谁拿的是方片 A？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody else here have the ace of diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 是我 方片 A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, it's me. Ace of diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来除了露拉 还有第五位骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we have a Fifth Horseman not named Lula.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:04:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上台来吧 你是助手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come up on stage, you're gonna be our helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞起 - 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! Yeah, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, uh, look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后… 睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝刀未老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子看着普通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this might look like an ordinary kid to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚 他将如鬼神附体般\N{\fnArial\fs30}but tonight, he is going to do extraordinary magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,施展魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a man possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,字面意思的“附体”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亨利 - 在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henley. - Yes, Merritt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你进到他身体里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind stepping inside his body?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. And, Jack, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也把自己扔进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't you throw yourself on in there, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我拿手\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… Oh, God help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯 你也进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas, why don't you slither on inside, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只好也挤进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I might as well wedge myself in there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人多力量大 方能创奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes a village to make magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,J·丹尼尔·阿特拉斯在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}J. Daniel Atlas in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看魔术吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who wants to see a magic trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了 梅里特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it away, Merritt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰 帅哥美女们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, you beautiful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,众所周知梅里特·麦金尼会读心术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, everyone knows that Merritt McKinney reads minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我是他 还是他是谁？天晓得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, I'm him.Or he's me. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我感觉到今晚有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm sensing someone came here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是来享受魔法的 而是来拆台的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to enjoy magic, but to tear it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷特·菲尼根在场吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a Brett Finnegan in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的狐朋狗友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you and your friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞了个“霍巴特营加密交易所”\N{\fnArial\fs30}set up the Camp Hobart Crypto Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 咋地？ - 就这业务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fact. Yep. Yeah. - It's what we're about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卷走了纽约市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took the good people of New York's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半的养老福利金\N{\fnArial\fs30}employee pension and welfare fund half its cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 那是四舍五入夸大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you're rounding up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且风险提示写得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and also, the risks were laid out very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.89,0:06:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿者上钩嘛 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knew what they were getting into, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你有没有把利润藏到海外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hide the profits offshore?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尾号为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Account ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,53297 的帐户？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in 53297?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能知道 除非你有我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't know that without my, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这是真金的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is this real gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷特 看好你的东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brett, you ought to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your things, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里特会读心 但我杰克嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merritt's a psychic, but me, Jack,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,手快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm into sleight of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚为缩小贫富差距做了贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've just done their part to close the wealth gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？搞什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 这就叫“再分配”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, here's a little redistribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着收律师函吧 我要揍死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawyer up, dude!I'll kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人忘了亨利会飞哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone forgot Henley can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来交给我们 但请给台上这位\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take it from here, but a round of applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最棒的骑士一点掌声\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the best Horseman on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂喂 行行行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真精彩 各位 举起酒杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic. So, everybody, I want you to take your drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把酒倒在你们的牌面上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want you to pour it onto the face of your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.53,0:07:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,每张牌显现出的12 个独特单词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those 12 unique words on each of your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是新加密钱包的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}form the password to your new crypto wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 登上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Log on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会发现布雷特偷的几百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll find Brett's stolen millions more…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,已公平退还\N{\fnArial\fs30}fairly redistributed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 五… 五万块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Fifty…50, 000 bucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,五万\N{\fnArial\fs30}50, 000!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're freaking done, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔喔 消消气 小姜饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa!Cool your head, gingerbread,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预见到了一个画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I am having a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,条子马上要破门而入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, maybe cops are gonna come bursting through that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你也变个魔术吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So perform a magic trickof your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧消失 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}and disappear in three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 凑近点 再近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come in close. Mm, closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你自以为看清的越多就越容易被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the more you think you see, the easier it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 旧瓶装新酒的把戏… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to dress up old tricks… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙骗过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fool you that they are new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs30\i0\c&HB7B9B0&\fad（1300，300）}惊\h天\h魔\h盗\h团\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs30\i0\c&HB7B9B0&\fad（1300，1000）}惊\h天\h魔\h盗\h团\N\N\N\N\N\NⅢ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得吧 你干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, in my opinion, I think you did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扮的阿特拉斯挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I think my Atlas was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但梅里特还得练练\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Merritt could probably use some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯-听着像个圣地牙哥的大烟鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. - It's like a San Diego stoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和捕虾船长的串儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a shrimp boat captain had a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 博斯科 你怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously, Bosco, I don't know how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,模仿秀不仅要声音像\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good impersonation isn't just about the mimicry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得抓细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about attention to detail,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,个性 神韵\N{\fnArial\fs30}personality and nuance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,行行行 我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.Let me try, let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 我是 J·丹尼尔·阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…I'm J. Daniel Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,离得越近 看得越瞎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closer you look, the less you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有内味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 再练练吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Uh, you'll work on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我刚那下不赖 - 是个好开头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wasn't bad. - It was a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但还得打磨 - 行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it could use some work. - Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你老盯着啥呢？ - 没事 没啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you keep looking at? - Nothing, nothing, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 振作点 看看我们 多风光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, cheer up.Guys, come on! Look at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们走了多远 今晚简直赚翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at how far we've come.We totally scored tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 下次 你戴那顶粉色假发 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, next time, you wear the pink wig, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 又锁上了 - 行 我来撬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude, it's locked again. - Okay, I'll pick it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别急 来那一招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, hold on.Do the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 求你了 来那一招\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Please do the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没必要吧 - 超帅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's so unnecessary. - It's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我帮你拿包 - 真没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll hold your bag. - It's so unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来嘛 多好玩 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, it's fun. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她就像个小马里奥 - 确实像马里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's like a little Mario. - She is like Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心 求你别死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, careful.Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？ 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是有这身手 我就天天翻墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could do that, I would only do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:09:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了-简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so cool. - It's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 太棒了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, that was awesome. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放我们进去 好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let us in. It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,全城最好的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best apartment in the whole city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 除了我们也没人能看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, and no one will ever see it but us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 每个人… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Everybody… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 但身披铠甲我是硬汉… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ But in my armor I am a man… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凑近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy is so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁发财了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's rich now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 能把那玩意关了吗？求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, can you turn that thing off, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我已经听够阿特拉斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've had enough Atlas for one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.83,0:10:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失者 必重现\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappears, reappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要戏法玩得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least if the trick is done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,博斯科 看看有披萨吗？我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosco, can you check for pizza? I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Four Horsemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没披萨但有啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pizza, but we got beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且 真的只有啤酒 - 再近点 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, no, literally just beer. - Closer. Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自以为看清的越多… - 谁要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the more you think you see… - Any takers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 说真的 把那玩意关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, seriously, turn that thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧 真逗 各位这边的投影仪在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Real funny, guys.Where's the other projector?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是全息影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我不是全息影像”对 是是是\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm not a hologram."Right. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,全息影像 都会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what a hologram would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 你是真人 - 别再摸我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, you're real. - Never touch my face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 我以为你是全息影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I thought that you were a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该那样的 我是你的超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never do that.I'm a huge fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我就花了大概 30 秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.Took me about 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我这么容易就找到了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it was this easy for me to find you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察找过来又有多难呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how hard would it be for the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 等等 警察？ - 对 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, hold on, the police? - Yeah, the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察为什么要找我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the police be looking for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不知道 也许是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't know, what about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚搞的那场抢劫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}little heist you just pulled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者因为你们私闯民宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the fact that you're squatting in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者你们偷的电\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that your electricity\Ncomes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从墙角电箱接出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the circuit box in the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢 啥都有可能 我说的对吗 波波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it could be anything. Am I right, Bozo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,博斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosco.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼-博斯科·勒罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. - Bosco Leroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 没错 对 博斯科·勒罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's right, yeah, Bosco Leroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你是从 ChatGPT 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did you type, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜了个“虚构魔术师名字”吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"fictional magician name"into ChatGPT?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是我的真名 阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's actually my real name, Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 跟你妈有一腿的是地图吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did your mom have sex with a map?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点也不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不了解我们 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about us, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我了如指掌 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know everything about you. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字可疑的博斯科·勒罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dubiously named Bosco Leroy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大好的演艺前程\N{\fnArial\fs30}a promising acting career.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,被沉重的助学贷款给毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut short by crippling student loans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:11:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从朱利亚德退学是挺遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bummer you had to drop out of Juilliard,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你从未停止表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you never stopped performing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 没记错的话 你上一份有薪工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if memory serves, your last paid gig,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在时代广场扮艾摩吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, was dressing as Elmo in Times Square?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我没扮过艾摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all, I was never Elmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是红色天线宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the red Teletubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,小波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥？ - 红色天线宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The red Teletubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她叫小波 - 哦 小波\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her name is Po. - Oh, Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my favorite one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她叫小波 - 可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her name is Po. - Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 琼·鲁克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, June Rouclere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,被爸妈强塞进的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kicked out of every boarding school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.07,0:12:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,每所寄宿学校都开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your parents forced you to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你不太喜欢服从权威啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a big fan of authority, I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得“老古董”们搞坏了这地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you think the "olds"broke the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这一代有责任来收拾烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's your generation's duty to clean up their mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说对了吗？ - 说错了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I right? - Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,全中\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你离家出走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, you ran away from home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路到了纽约 在坦宁魔术店\N{\fnArial\fs30}made your way to New York, where you ran into this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇见了这家伙 查理·盖伊斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Tannin's Magic Shop, Charlie Gayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, hi. - Yeah, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,网上关于你的资料不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually couldn't find a lot about you online.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道你是孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, I do know you were an orphan and.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,童年一直在寄养家庭间辗转流离\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were in and out of foster care your entire childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到遇上这俩货\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you didn't know the meaning of family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才懂了什么是家\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you hooked up with these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你们三个这几年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, the three of you have been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在演你们的罗宾汉小把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}your little Robin Hood act for years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图用一个个戏法改变世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to change the world one trick at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到这回玩了把大的 也就是盗用我的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}all leading to your riskiest theft to date, my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你在场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把我们的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had our faces plastered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,贴满了全城的脚手架和地铁站\N{\fnArial\fs30}on every scaffolding and subway stop in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 这侵权了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's copyright infringement, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what'd you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你的梅里特还得练练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your Merritt needs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就说吧 - 别提这茬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it. - That's a sensitive topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你懂个屁 - 他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't even get it. - No. He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但整体设计令人印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But overall design was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该就是那个闷葫芦吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's you, I assume, the quiet guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 典型的幕后推手 - 嗯 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Textbook, behind the scenes. - Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚历山大·赫尔曼… - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alexander Herrmann… - Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说过 真正设计魔术的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said that the people who designed his tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是真正的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}were the real geniuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.23,0:13:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你知道他的大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that you know that man's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你是“幕后”的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"behind the scenes" clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 手法很高超 非常灵巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, your sleight of hand was advanced. Good dexterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,身手敏捷 真的 我很佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quick and nimble on your feet. Really, I was impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来我们挺棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like we're pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,差得远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're far from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.61,0:13:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 稍微调教一下 也许能成\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, maybe with a little fine tuning, you could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.58,0:13:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概明白为什么“天眼”让我来找你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I could… I could see why The Eye sent me to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 等等 你是说“天眼”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Wait, did you say "The Eye"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 天眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, The Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周前这张卡片寄到了我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This card arrived at my apartment three weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有四张机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with four plane tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹层里藏着指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}and instructions hidden in the lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要完成一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a trick bigger and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,前所未有的惊天魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}than anything you have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 居然指名要带上你们三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trick that, for some reason, includes the three of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们？ - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Us?Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不是其他骑士？ - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not the other Horsemen? - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他骑士都死透了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the other horsemen are dead. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 他们已经死透了 别打岔\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, they're dead to me.Stop interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家闹情绪 散伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, things got emotional.Everyone quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去澳洲流浪了一圈 说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a walkabout in Australia.It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在你需要我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you need us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡片上是这么说的 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to that card, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们不需要你 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we don't need you, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,博斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosco.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？我们要这家伙干嘛？我们混得风生水起\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What do we need this guy for? We're crushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,风生水起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crushing it? You're stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就偷那玩币小子一点钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little money from some crypto bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说钓大鱼 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about big fish here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说干一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about something that will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正能改变世界的大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}make a real difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这才是你们的追求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that's what you kids are all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is. No, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我觉得大鱼我们可以自己钓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I think we can catch our own fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们行？不不 他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can?No, no, he…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你们好运 - 啥？别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that. - What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you just wait one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？这… 这是咋回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? What's… what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可是 J·丹尼尔·阿特拉斯 - 我知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is J. Daniel Atlas. - Yeah, I know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a freaking legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是传奇 现在有点混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a legend.Now he's just kind of a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个… 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you…Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,博斯科 他确实混蛋 但他也是骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosco, he's kind of a dick, but he is a Horseman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:14:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这次就信我们一回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, just trust us on this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 做决定吧孩子们 怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Decision time, kids.What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,入局…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是出局？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术怎么玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\i0}南非 - 林波波
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 尊贵的社区成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, esteemed community members,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位媒体朋友 亲友和同事们\N{\fnArial\fs30}valued press, friends and colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an6\i0}范德伯格集团\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们欢聚一堂 共同庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gathered here tonight to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,范德伯格集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vanderberg's latest and greatest mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最新最大的矿井 C3 也就是我们爱称的\N{\fnArial\fs30}C3, or as we like to call her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,“阿玛莱”祖鲁语意为“美丽之人”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Amahle, " Zulu for "The Beautiful One."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在母亲眼中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because every child is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个孩子都是美丽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the eyes of its mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的客户可以放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our customer can rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们购买这世上最伟大的爱之象征时\N{\fnArial\fs30}that when they buy the world's greatest symbol of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是伴随着爱诞生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was produced with nothing but.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬阿玛莱 敬各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Amahle, and to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢大家远道而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you all so much for making the trip out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大家都对阿玛莱印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I take it you were all impressed by Amahle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.43,0:16:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 是 C3 矿井\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, C3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真有戏剧性 哇 太神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's quite dramatic.Yeah, it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你是特意挑了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I also understand that you have chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好日子来提意见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this fine day to broach some concerns,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,出乎你意料的是 我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, contrary to your expectations, I don't begrudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 呃 董事会觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, um, the board feels that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,预期可能太乐观了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}projections might be optimistic…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着人造钻石的竞争加剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}with increasing competition from lab grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一贷款利率暴跌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, in the event borrowing rates plum…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉 威廉\N{\fnArial\fs30}William. William.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲很欣赏你 但他管你叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father loved you, but there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,“扫把星”是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a reason he called you his dark cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,范德伯格家族从不失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vanderberg family does not lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所知 我们的车队刚刚赢得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you're well aware, our motorsports team just won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七次摩纳哥锦标赛冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Monaco Championship for the seventh time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿一定会出货\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mine will produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,定价 你设定的底价…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pricing. The minimums that you've set for…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉 赏个脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you humor me, William?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,配合我不吝赐教一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a demonstration about reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗钻石 大概 55 克拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This diamond is say, what, 55 carats?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,安特卫普中心估价300 万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}The AWDC would price it at 3, 000, 000 US dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉 张开嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}William, will you open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把舌头伸出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stick out your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 认真的？ - 认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.35,0:17:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果威廉把它吞下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if William here were to swallow it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗钻石会把他的喉咙割烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}that selfsame diamond would tear his throat to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护车赶到前他就会失血而亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would bleed to death before paramedics arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 对中心来说它值 300 万\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, to the AWDC, it's 3, 000, 000,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对威廉来说 它是无价之宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to William, priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么告诉我 作为掌管着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me then, as the CEO responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界最后几座大钻矿的 CEO\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the world's last great diamond mines,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.77,0:17:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是该压低利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}should I undercut our profits,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是定一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}or should I choose prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那些特殊客户愿意付的价格？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I know our unique clients will pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非还有其他问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless there are more concerns,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带着价目表去安特卫普了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to head to Antwerp with my price list.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去炫耀一下我们的石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and show off our stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 你知道你本来可以用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, you know, you probably could have led.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,“免费欧洲游”来开场的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a free trip to Europe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道吗 关于安特卫普\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a little known fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个冷知识…\N{\fnArial\fs30}about Antwerp is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 又是魔术冷知识 真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great, more magic trivia. This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\i0}安特卫普 - 比利时\N\N\N\N\N\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was just gonna say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的饼干很好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}they make great biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.71,0:18:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？能给我们买点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, do they? Can we actually get some, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯买单 必须的 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Atlas, obviously.No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才不给你们买饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I'm not getting you biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚请你们吃了巧克力 行了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got you chocolates, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这不是去度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, this is not a vacation, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有三天时间准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have three days to prepare an effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,得设计出一个让你们那蹩脚的“佩珀尔幻象”\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll make your barely passable Pepper's Ghost trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像原始人涂鸦的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}look like a cave painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.89,0:18:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋之心 史上最昂贵的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Heart Diamond, the most valuable jewel in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是范德伯格矿业集团的基石\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the foundation of the Vanderberg Mining Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来 家族一直将这块巨石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for years, the family's kept this big rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.01,0:19:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在秘密金库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}hidden inside their secret vault,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,深埋地下 70 层\N{\fnArial\fs30}70 stories underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不在别处 就在阿拉伯沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not just any ground.The Arabian Desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了亲信团队 无人涉足\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one beyond their most trusted team has been inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,入口只有一部电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access through a single elevator,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,全天候武装守卫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}constantly monitored by armed guards…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}身份验证通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identity verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and behind a multi-level.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.01,0:19:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,多层生物识别安保系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}biometric security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但全世界都将瞩目\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the world will be watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为半个世纪以来 这是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}because for the first time in half a century,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗钻石被运到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that diamond is being traveled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,安特卫普 为了在这场私人拍卖会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Antwerp, to establish credibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,给三天后即将拍卖的新货\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to spur bidding at a private auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,树立信誉 刺激竞价\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the company's latest finds in three days' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.67,0:20:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 偷东西我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, obviously, I'm down for stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这颗钻石有什么特别的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what makes this diamond so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为神奇塔罗牌叫我们这么做 对吧 琼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because the magical tarot card told us to, June, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,行行 挺逗的 能不能让我说完？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, that's very cute.But can I please finish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没说完？天 你都说了半天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not finished? Jeez, you've been talking forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我还要继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and I'm about to talk more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 专心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, please, pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几十年来 先是皮特·范德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}For decades, first, Peter Vanderberg,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是他女儿维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}now his daughter, Veronika,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直高价兜售这些钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been selling these diamonds at inflated prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖给世界各地的军火商 人贩子 军阀\N{\fnArial\fs30}to arms dealers, traffickers, warlords the world over,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮他们洗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}to, like, help launder their money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 这些钱是脏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I mean, the cash is dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至可以说 是沾满鲜血的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, in some cases, it's, like, literally blood-soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.49,0:20:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 瞧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, voila…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这些宝石一换钱就洗白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's cleaned in exchange for these precious stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说 她简直是万恶之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}She makes all the world's worst people possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不管是谁寄来了塔罗牌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, whoever sent that tarot card…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是世上仅存的义士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the few truly honorable people left in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一还在乎正义的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only people that still care about justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经很久没联系他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're people I haven't spoken to in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自称“天眼”\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call themselves "The Eye, "
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要我们去做一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they want us to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,连四骑士都做不到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Horsemen never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a chance to drive a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底干掉那个女魔头\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the heart of the devil herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚拍卖会上所有人都会盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All eyes will be on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那颗“海洋之心”\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Heart tonight at the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须光彩照人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to look dazzling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那个“小猫之吻”色号吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have that Kitten Kiss color?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,勒塔博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lethabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在？ - 稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes? - Straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:18.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,那个《名利场》的英国摄影师是谁来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that British photographer from Vanity Fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 叫什么名？马克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what's his name again? Marc…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克·斯克里伯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marc Scriber?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.41,0:21:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 施赖伯 天啊 - 施赖伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Schreiber, good God. - Schreiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认他的行程 取消其他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm him, cancel the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.15,0:21:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年我们是广撒网 今年我们要搞“独家”\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went wide last year.This year, exclusivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 - 我们要开放 透明\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. - We're open, transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没什么可隐瞒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 完美 我去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, perfect.I'll have it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.09,0:21:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Veronika.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 嘘 小宝贝 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Hush little baby ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 别说话 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Don't say a word ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 爸爸给你买只模仿鸟 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Papa's gonna buy you a mocking bird ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 如果那只模仿鸟 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ And if that mocking bird ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vacate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 不唱歌 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Don't sing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么有这个号码？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 爸爸给你买个大钻戒 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Papa's gonna buy you a diamond ring ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是私人专线 而且你也太五音不全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a private line, and that was a bit tone deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:21:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Veronika.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你左边的储物柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The storage unit to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.13,0:22:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着眼熟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.70,0:22:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是 15 年前死去的那个男孩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belonged to that boy who died 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是对我还是对别人这都不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This means nothing to me or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都很清楚你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I both know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你有实锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you have real evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.11,0:22:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,想搞垮我为什么不直接放出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're out to get me, why not just use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,15 年前 你夺走了你父亲的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen years ago, you took what your father loved most.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要以牙还牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm going to do the same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要海洋之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the Heart Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把它交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.16,0:22:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就竖起一面照妖镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'm going to hold up a looking glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让全世界看清你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the whole world to see you as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便 我没什么可隐瞒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. I have nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克·施赖伯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.00,0:23:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9}免费拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 能帮我找找这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Can you help me find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs16\fad（0，1500）}字幕制作：{\fs20\c&H4080FF&}leslie727{\fs20\c&HFFFFFF&}\h\h&\h\h{\1c&HFF8646&\3c&HAE1C14&\bord10\blur10}葫 芦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都找了一个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking literally for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 就在那边 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's gonna be right over there, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克·施赖伯 我是詹姆斯·温 范德伯格公关部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marc Schreiber, James Winn, Vanderberg PR.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,久仰大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huge admirer of your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.05,0:23:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯？丹妮去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James? What happened to Dani?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 丹妮啊 很遗憾 我们不得不解雇了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dani. Yeah, sadly, we had to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.36,0:23:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来她有种族歧视倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out she was racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 她居然给你订了雷迪森蓝标酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also, she booked you into the Radisson Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.06,0:23:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是视野不佳的双人间 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in a partial view, double. - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.30,0:24:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我自作主张帮你换到了 FRANQ 酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankfully, I took the liberty of moving you to the FRANQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.87,0:24:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超爱 FRANQ\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do love the FRANQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.47,0:24:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 只有总统套房才配得上总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the presidential suite is befitting of, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.44,0:24:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及像您这样才华横溢的摄影师\N{\fnArial\fs30}presidents and talented photographers like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.31,0:24:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 您的晚宴邀请函已经改寄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, your gala invitation has been rerouted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我确认一下您的预订信息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could just check your confirmation?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.09,0:24:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还把您的拍摄时间从 7 点推到了 9 点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also bumped your shoot from 7:00 to 9:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.42,0:24:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让您有充足的时间施展您的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give you proper time to make your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.16,0:24:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 终于有个懂行的了 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone gets it. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2\i0\c&H00EAFF&}安特卫普
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.00,0:24:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ {\an7\c&HFFFFFF&}Diamond - Angelina Jordan {\c&HFFDB00&}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.00,0:24:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我像超新星一样闪耀 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I'm shinin' like a supernova ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 高举双手敞开心扉… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ With my hands up high And my heart wide open… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.14,0:24:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我像钻石一样更加璀璨 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I shine even more bright Like a diamond ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.05,0:24:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 将恐惧从肩头拂去… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Brush that fear right off my shoulder… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.31,0:24:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿实验室培育的钻石来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take, for instance, diamonds created in laboratories.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,号称有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}They purport to have value,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.19,0:24:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但既不天然也不稀有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're neither natural nor rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.46,0:24:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个诚实的女人希望手指上戴着个谎言呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What honest woman wants a falsehood on her finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.36,0:24:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.56,0:25:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间仅存的伟大真理之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the great truths left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.26,0:25:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是天然宝石所蕴含的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the power behind a natural gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的钻石能让人充满激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real diamonds fill people with passion,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几个世纪以来皆是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they have for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.67,0:25:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 事实上 玛丽·安托瓦内特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.In fact, Marie-Antoinette,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只戴了一天“希望蓝钻”\N{\fnArial\fs30}wore the Hope Diamond for a single day,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.17,0:25:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a month later…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.34,0:25:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就被推上了断头台\N{\fnArial\fs30}was dragged to the guillotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.71,0:25:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一群 嗯 如你所说 充满激情的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by some very, well, as you say, passionate folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.14,0:25:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·安托瓦内特不是死于钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie-Antoinette didn't die because of a diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.05,0:25:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是死于极度缺乏同理心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died because of a monstrous lack of empathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.38,0:25:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 她从未戴过那颗钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And truth is, she never even wore the Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是人们相信她戴过\N{\fnArial\fs30}People just believe she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.39,0:25:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？这倒挺有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?That's kind of interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.85,0:25:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以杀她的不是暴民\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was not the mob that killed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.46,0:25:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是断头台\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was not the guillotine,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.69,0:25:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是一个… 故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a… a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我对自己请的人不太了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must not know my own guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.40,0:25:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是做钻石生意的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in the diamond business?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我和你一样 是做“幻觉”生意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I'm in the illusion business, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.73,0:25:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 几百年来 钻石一文不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, for centuries, diamonds were worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.90,0:25:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到像维罗妮卡这样极度聪明富有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}until some very smart, very rich people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.97,0:25:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们这些小小的玻璃碴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Veronika here, told us that, not only.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.21,0:25:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅稀有\N{\fnArial\fs30}are these little shards of glass rare,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且任何有自尊的情侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that no self-respecting couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.24,0:25:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚时都必须得来一颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}could possibly get married without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.61,0:25:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这才是真正的高明魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, now, that one is a good magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个魔术的问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem with the trick is, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有好戏最后都有个意想不到的反转\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the good ones have a little twist in the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.99,0:26:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.09,0:26:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is what me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.99,0:26:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然不是 - 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course not. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.83,0:26:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我要不像你的其他客人那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you wouldn't have let me in had I not demonstrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.76,0:26:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,展现出极高的道德水准 你也不会放我进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the finest moral fiber, like some of your other guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.60,0:26:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边那位是军火商路易斯·布里塞尼奥吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I notice Luis Briseño, the arms dealer over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.04,0:26:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有玛丽亚·博特尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course, Maria Bortnick, when starstruck,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边从容交际一边垄断着官方媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}how she manages to mingle while monopolizing her state media.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你也愿意表明身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd care to reveal yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.75,0:26:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们也能好好审视一下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can apply the same scrutiny to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.25,0:26:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.79,0:26:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.19,0:26:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,随他去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him eat cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克·施赖伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marc Schreiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗妮卡·范德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veronika Vanderberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.90,0:26:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们速战速决 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make this quick, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍卖会马上开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our auction begins shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.11,0:26:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你会把我和海洋之心拍得完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you can do me and the Heart justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但我有个规矩 那就是我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I only have one rule.What I say goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.88,0:27:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我相信我能找到温顺的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure I can find my submissive side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你找不到我会帮你找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if not, I'll find it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.62,0:27:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.89,0:27:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.27,0:27:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太哑光了 好的好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be too matte.Sure. Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.40,0:27:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢鼻翼发亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't like the sides of my nose shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.27,0:27:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.91,0:27:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我看看 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Show me. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.47,0:27:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 镜头里这只小苍蝇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, can the little fruit fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能请你走开 走开 走开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my shot please shoo, shoo, shoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.78,0:27:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.31,0:27:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一比那颗钻石更值钱的就是我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing more valuable than that diamond is my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.85,0:27:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我调查过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did my research on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.79,0:27:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行业和我的行业一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your industry, like mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.25,0:27:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都充斥着人造的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}is besieged by manufacturer lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你 你展现的是真实之美\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, you bring us beauty as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我们很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're alike in that regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.63,0:27:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不卖弄虚假 我们贩卖真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't sell contrivance, we sell reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.63,0:27:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 我们根本不用卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I would argue that we don't sell at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.87,0:27:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人抢着买\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.04,0:27:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.74,0:28:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.78,0:28:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 那个钻石 拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… The diamond, take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.15,0:28:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,玻璃反光会毁了照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glare in the glass will mar the photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.96,0:28:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法容忍瑕疵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't tolerate imperfections.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.59,0:28:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想像范德伯格女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't imagine someone as ravishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样迷人的人也不会容忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Ms. Vanderberg does either.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.69,0:28:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 要么拿出来要么另请高明\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, take it out or find yourself a new photographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.39,0:28:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我就等你这句话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In truth, I was hoping you'd ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.05,0:28:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得我有说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.00,0:28:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.20,0:29:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,美极了 保持住 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful. Work it. Fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fabulous. Fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.37,0:29:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.67,0:29:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 微笑 享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Smiling, we're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.44,0:29:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们想要的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.91,0:29:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.12,0:29:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要的大片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the money shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.95,0:29:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.89,0:29:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 女士 离远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, ma'am, are far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.46,0:29:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想… 想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying…I'm trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.93,0:29:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她脑门比那钻石还亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her forehead is shinier than the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.93,0:29:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我在做我的工作 我不听你指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'm doing my job.I don't take orders from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.90,0:29:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要事关海洋之心你就得听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it comes to the Heart, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.43,0:29:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去 - 我… 我自己会走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out. - I… I can walk myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.93,0:29:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.90,0:29:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,施赖伯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Schreiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.24,0:29:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真如你所说的那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're all you purport to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.77,0:29:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该已经拍到你想要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should already have what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.04,0:29:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绰绰有余 谢谢 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More than enough. Thank you. - Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.42,0:29:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作愉快 但我还有买家在等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been a pleasure, but I have buyers waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.35,0:29:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了 受够了这帮人胡闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough of this of this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.09,0:29:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保存放安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure it's secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 勒塔博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Lethabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.99,0:30:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么 怎么回事？ - 不知道 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell, what happened? - I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.10,0:30:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's ticking. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于 万众期待的拍卖会开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last, the auction we've all been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.18,0:30:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚能坐在这里的各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you're here tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.58,0:30:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概觉得自己什么世面都见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you probably think you've seen everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.65,0:30:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要问问你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it is to you that I ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.69,0:30:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的见过一切吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.36,0:30:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗钻石已经 25 年未曾现世\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not been seen in person for a quarter of a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.30,0:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今仍是史上最大的钻石 海洋之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still the largest diamond ever discovered, the Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.04,0:30:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.91,0:30:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然逍遥法外了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for getting away with it for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.85,0:30:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜怎么着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.61,0:30:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,气候变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climate change.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.98,0:30:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't believe in you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.28,0:30:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从地球母亲身上榨取财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tore your fortunes from our Mother Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.82,0:31:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐着私人飞机 烧毁她的天空…\N{\fnArial\fs30}set fire to her skies in your private jets…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.99,0:31:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了 她懂了 - 对对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, she gets it. - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.13,0:31:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你们无尽的贪婪把她榨干…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bled her dry with your insatiable…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.73,0:31:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人 我们都想拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man, we all want to save the world here,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.70,0:31:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但时间宝贵 你正在浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but time is also precious and you're wasting mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.07,0:31:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧 闪光女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip it, sparkles.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.94,0:31:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stop sucking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.47,0:31:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,塑料吸管吸溜了 吸这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}on plastic straws, and suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.38,0:31:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的客人们 我是 J·丹尼尔·阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honored guests.My name is J. Daniel Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.82,0:31:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为魔术四骑士中你们最爱的一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may remember me as your personal favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.99,0:31:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家应该还记得我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Four Horsemen of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.82,0:31:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看仔细了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.22,0:31:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让那颗着名的海洋之心 出现在我手心\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I make the famous Heart Diamond appear on my palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.59,0:31:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 他和绿色和平组织一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee-whiz, he must be as starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺爱缺关注啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}for attention as Greenpeace here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.73,0:31:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 钻石非常安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest assured that the diamond is completely safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.17,0:31:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位智者曾告诉我 其实就是对着镜子说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, a wise man once told me, in the mirror, in fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.44,0:31:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别自以为你是屋里最聪明的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, never assume you're the smartest person in the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.71,0:31:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明它\N{\fnArial\fs30}prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.24,0:31:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.45,0:32:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那就看看 能不能把这柜子打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's see if we can get that case open.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.75,0:32:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 阿布拉卡达布拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Abracadabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.38,0:32:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵 没开 呃… 急急如律令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Nope. Uh… Alakazam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.75,0:32:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.29,0:32:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.56,0:32:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.86,0:32:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这儿依然安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.97,0:32:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 放松 嗯 放松 维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Relax. Mm, relax, Veronika.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.47,0:32:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你的广告词所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as your ads like to remind us,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石恒久远\N{\fnArial\fs30}diamonds are forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.57,0:32:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 护送她离开 快 - 拦住他 拦住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her to safety. Now!-You stop him! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.58,0:32:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.45,0:32:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克-嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.65,0:32:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么在这儿？ - 救你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - Saving your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.05,0:32:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊-不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.15,0:32:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也收到卡片了 呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one, too. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.72,0:32:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 我是琼 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. I'm June. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.12,0:32:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁？抱歉 自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's she? Sorry, she's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.00,0:32:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the diamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.64,0:32:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.67,0:33:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们根本不关心环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you guys don't care about the environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.84,0:33:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比看起来强壮多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.18,0:33:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.34,0:33:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安：嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}SECURITY GUARD: Hey! Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.55,0:33:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 别让他们跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.95,0:33:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在咋办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.42,0:33:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的卡片只说把你弄出来 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}My card just said to get you out of there. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.82,0:33:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·里维斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henley Reeves?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.53,0:33:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我贴了好多你的海报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have so many posters of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是我童年的… - 行了 追星的事稍后再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're my childhood… - All right, fanboy later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过… 见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it does, uh… You know, it is really nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:34:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头再追星 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fanboy later. We got to go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.54,0:34:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands up and don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.08,0:34:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.88,0:34:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝多芬 D 大调协奏曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beethoven's Concerto in D major.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.02,0:34:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯淡 扯淡 真扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit, bullshit, bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.92,0:34:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 梅里特？那是什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Merritt? What…What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.73,0:34:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯 我想看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas, I would like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.50,0:34:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,用“比利时语”催眠三个大汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}hypnotize three dudes in Belgian.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.73,0:34:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说弗拉芒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Flemish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 这就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.10,0:34:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,感人的重逢 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely reunion. We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.87,0:34:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·里维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henley Reeves!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.74,0:34:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎归队 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome back!-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.67,0:34:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我说一句 你真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may I say, you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.21,0:34:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 快走快走 - 对对对 走走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, come on, let's go!-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.41,0:34:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想夸夸她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was paying her a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.01,0:34:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为见到她很高兴 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it was nice to see her, and only her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.08,0:34:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是… - 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was… - We get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.12,0:34:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.63,0:35:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇 是来接我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!Is that for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.90,0:35:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到还有别人在逃命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see any other people trying to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.43,0:35:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.97,0:35:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.44,0:35:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 一直在我也手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it was in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.38,0:35:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole time. It never…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.95,0:35:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没换钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't swap the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.68,0:35:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们换的是箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They swapped the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.15,0:36:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 女士 离远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, ma'am, are far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再用塑料吸管吸溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stop sucking on plastic straws,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.57,0:36:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.99,0:36:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的客人们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honored guests…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.15,0:36:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.13,0:36:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.40,0:36:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石恒久远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds are forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.47,0:36:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 勒塔博 - 在 夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lethabo. - Yes, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.47,0:36:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让他们后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to make them regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.74,0:36:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,加倍后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.84,0:36:58.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,马克·施赖伯 《名利场》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marc Schreiber, Vanity Fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.41,0:37:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.39,0:37:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 我还以为会更闪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I thought it'd be shinier.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.66,0:37:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.All right, give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.76,0:37:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛？ - 噢 抱歉 太滑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Oh. Sorry. It's so slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.66,0:37:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 喂 - 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Hey. - Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, don't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.03,0:37:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我能问问 这帮小屁孩是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I address the, uh, infant in the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.44,0:37:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 他们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.54,0:37:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这群好孩子用 AI 换脸伪造了我们的演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the wonderful kids that deepfaked our show.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.28,0:37:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？ 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.98,0:37:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你们害得警察冲进我家的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had the cops sent to my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.91,0:37:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们吓坏我孩子了 - 呃 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You freaked out my kids. - Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.61,0:37:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真对不起 - 抱歉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry about that. - Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.95,0:37:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the kids, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.45,0:37:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了它抛弃我们的无聊郊区生活过得还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is the whole boring suburban life you left us for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.18,0:37:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别这样 你错过了机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, relax, man.You missed your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.75,0:37:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哼 - 看到那颗钻多大没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. - See the size of that rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.56,0:37:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.02,0:37:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不是海洋之心但也挺惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, it's no Heart Diamond, but it's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.69,0:37:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早告诉你了 丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told you, Danny.I didn't feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.86,0:37:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我挺着六个月大肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to escape from a straitjacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.30,0:37:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒吊着穿束身衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}hanging upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.60,0:37:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得不安全 - 至于嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was six months pregnant. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.10,0:37:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后我们会把你翻过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would have flipped you right side up at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.77,0:37:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have been fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.93,0:37:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 你们根本没想我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - You guys didn't even miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.30,0:37:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找替补花了好久？一下午？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long did it take you to replace me? An afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.07,0:38:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 确切说 是大半个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, and the better part of an evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.34,0:38:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 说到这 露拉呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, speaking of, how is Lula?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.91,0:38:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩还… - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you guys still, uh… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.55,0:38:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她… 她搬去巴黎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh… she moved to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.98,0:38:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 她甩了伟大的 J·怀尔德？天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. She dumped the great J. Wilder. My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.28,0:38:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾 节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.45,0:38:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在不该在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you need to be on some, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.72,0:38:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,某艘游轮上丢人现眼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}cruise ship somewhere humiliating yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.82,0:38:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丢人现眼？ - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Humiliating myself? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.46,0:38:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每趟游轮赚五位数外加福利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make five figures per cruise, plus perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.76,0:38:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,“外加福利”他说“外加福利”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Plus perks."He said, "plus perks."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.39,0:38:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为梅里特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought Merritt drinking himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.66,0:38:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在墨西哥酗酒等死已经够惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to death in Mexico was depressing. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.09,0:38:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这个 我还得继续喝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of, I got to get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.06,0:38:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肝可不会自己喝废\N{\fnArial\fs30}This liver's not gonna destroy itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.73,0:38:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 能让这玩意靠岸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, can we dry dock this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.64,0:38:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.07,0:38:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 叙旧很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, I mean, great catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.34,0:38:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个十年再见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I don't know, what, see you in another ten?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.64,0:38:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你们 小蝌蚪们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you, little tadpoles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.81,0:38:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.31,0:38:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？我也要撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what?I'm out of here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.31,0:38:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有场演出要赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a gig to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.42,0:38:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？他们给你报销打车费吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?They're covering your Uber?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.52,0:38:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,签了保密协议 无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signed an NDA. Can't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.32,0:38:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.55,0:38:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个把手没一个能打开这破门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six handles and none of them open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.66,0:38:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为在跟谁说话？让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think you're talking to? Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.53,0:38:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.93,0:38:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之间发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's going on with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.60,0:38:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我感觉这儿有很多奇怪的历史遗留问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting the feeling there's a lot of weird history here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.33,0:38:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,气氛有点尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and things are a little awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.86,0:39:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你们曾经是四骑士啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you guys, you used to be the Horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.17,0:39:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你们为什么要解散？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.Why did you break up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.17,0:39:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,问他们 问问他们为什么解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask them.Ask them why we broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.64,0:39:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能做主 我们根本不会散\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was up to me, we wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.54,0:39:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天眼想让我们… - 不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Eye wanted us to… - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭露一个俄罗斯军火商\N{\fnArial\fs30}expose a Russian arms dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.05,0:39:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非得再揭一遍伤疤吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we really have to live through this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.98,0:39:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们犯了些大错 我们变得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made some huge mistakes, we got…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.45,0:39:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 散漫 - 自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sloppy. - Cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.79,0:39:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们 迪伦·施莱克再也无法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of us, Dylan Shrike will never see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.66,0:39:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出俄罗斯监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the outside of a Russian prison again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.33,0:39:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 迪伦·施莱克 行了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Dylan Shrike. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.53,0:39:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是骑士 拜托 做做功课吧 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Horseman. Come on.Do your homework, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.70,0:39:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉 各位 我真不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.Guys, I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.90,0:39:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 他被永远关在里面了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, he's stuck in there forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.30,0:39:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这显然是个悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is obviously a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.74,0:39:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也永远无法原谅自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}and something I'll never forgive myself for.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.97,0:39:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也一样 行吧 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nor will I. - Yeah, fine, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.04,0:39:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不意味着你们就得不干了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it didn't mean you have to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.11,0:39:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that is, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真扫兴 各位 抱歉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really a bummer, guys.Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.81,0:39:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,“扫兴”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A bummer"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.18,0:39:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我真是爱死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I… I love the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.55,0:39:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这代人那种言简意赅的总结方式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your generation sums things up so eloquently.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.09,0:39:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能给我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, someone explain to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.49,0:39:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这帮没长毛的小孩会在这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why these pre-pubes are even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same reason you are, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.03,0:40:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eye wanted 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.23,0:40:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 海洋之心到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got the Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.56,0:40:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼接下来想让我们干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does The Eye want us to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.23,0:40:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 我只知道一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No idea. - I know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.37,0:40:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们手里拿着价值五亿美金的钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a half a billion dollar diamond in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.67,0:40:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会联系我们的 - 是啊 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're gonna get in touch. - Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.74,0:40:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 阿特拉斯 能看看你的卡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, wait, wait.Atlas, can I see your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.58,0:40:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.38,0:40:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.78,0:40:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 是张地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - It's a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.09,0:40:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 阿特拉斯 是你爸 - 不 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Atlas, it's your dad. - No, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.42,0:40:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有四骑士聚齐才会显现的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a map that only reveals itself when the Horsemen are together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.53,0:40:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美 真的吗 哥们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fat chance.Really, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.10,0:40:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.43,0:40:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼显然想让你们一起干这票\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eye obviously wants you guys to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.23,0:40:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是四骑士 拿出点骑士的样子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the Horsemen.Start acting like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.31,0:40:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.54,0:40:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想罗萨里托可以再等几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose Rosarito can wait a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.41,0:40:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我可以试着改一下演出时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I can try to reschedule this gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.28,0:40:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太容易 但我会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna be easy, but I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.75,0:41:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我还真有点怀念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I have kind of missed running for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.76,0:41:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们一起亡命天涯跳屋顶的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and jumping off roofs with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.36,0:41:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎归队 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good to have you back. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.43,0:41:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这是哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so where is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.10,0:41:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\i0\fad（0，2000）}法国 - 鲁西永城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.11,0:41:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这儿干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to be doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.01,0:41:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼会告诉我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eye will let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.78,0:41:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 拍照时间 - 你干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, picture time. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.28,0:41:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍照啊 现在情侣都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking a photo.That's what couples do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.65,0:41:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别把绝密地点的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't post photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.01,0:41:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,发到网上 别嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the top secret location.Don't be jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.85,0:41:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想入镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want to be in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.02,0:41:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我还真不想入镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.I don't want to be in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.42,0:41:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这会被当成… 回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it can be used for…For memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.99,0:41:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是回忆 是呈堂证供\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not memories.Evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.29,0:41:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵 我从没见过这种门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. I've never seen a door like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.50,0:41:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I can't open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.37,0:41:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.67,0:41:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是说“琼”吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Don't you mean "June"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.80,0:41:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克是我们的开锁专家 - 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack's our lockpick. - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.64,0:41:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来有点良性竞争的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a little healthy competish.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.31,0:41:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.71,0:41:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开锁的时候她还没出生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been picking locks since before she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.21,0:42:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找找锁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me find the keyhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.81,0:42:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在那边 在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the other side.Yeah, it's underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.12,0:42:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在这样可没什么说服力啊 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not inspiring confidence right now, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.12,0:42:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他行的 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got it.Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.65,0:42:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他行的 - 手生了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got it. - Feeling rusty?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.19,0:42:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别催我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't rush me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.32,0:42:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么时候开始开锁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When does he start the lock picking?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.63,0:42:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杰克 我觉得这锁不是用来撬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jack, I don't think this is a lock you pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.83,0:42:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用来解的 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a lock you solve. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.20,0:42:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他露一手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.97,0:42:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.37,0:42:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我快速搞定这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I just figure this out real quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.68,0:42:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.58,0:42:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你玩过密室逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've ever done an escape room,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.72,0:42:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道会有各种谜题\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd know there are all kinds of different puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是锁和钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just about locks and keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.26,0:42:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.66,0:42:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该更新下技能库了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to update your game, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.36,0:42:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.40,0:42:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那请吧 带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, by all means, lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.40,0:42:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得最后那下还是他松开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he loosened it for her, ultimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.37,0:42:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呵 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh. - Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.74,0:43:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.81,0:43:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术宅男的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic nerd heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.44,0:43:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,P T 塞尔比特的棺材？\N{\fnArial\fs30}P.T. Selbit's coffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.01,0:43:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.08,0:43:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 胡迪尼的束身衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, Houdini's straitjacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.12,0:43:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.42,0:43:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看在往日情分上我能把你塞进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I put you in here for old time's sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.62,0:43:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 不要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.19,0:43:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得挺好玩的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.26,0:43:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖 你想进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot. You wanna come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.26,0:43:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不想 - 那就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.60,0:43:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 快看这个 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, check this out, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.57,0:43:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.07,0:43:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,徒手接子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullet catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.27,0:43:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.04,0:43:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.15,0:43:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死胡同？ - 对 死胡同\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dead end? - Yeah, dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.12,0:43:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.49,0:43:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or, is it? - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.63,0:43:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.20,0:44:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.07,0:44:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.04,0:44:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,骰子应该在这里球应该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The die should be here and the ball should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.75,0:44:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.92,0:44:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.96,0:44:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,四行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four rows.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.12,0:44:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,1 5 8 4？是密码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, five, eight, four?Is it a code?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.59,0:44:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1 1 5 6 18… - 减去 4\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One, one, five, six, 18… - Minus four.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.80,0:44:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1 8 9？-15 84-\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, eight, nine? - Fifteen, eighty-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.13,0:44:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什… - 1584\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 1584. - Wha…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.70,0:44:34.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,《妖术的发现》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Discoverie of Witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.30,0:44:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一本关于舞台魔术的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first book on stage magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.60,0:44:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是它的出版年份\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's when it was published.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.67,0:44:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 他怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, how does he know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.20,0:44:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 他基本上就是台装满无用知识的电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he's basically a computer full of useless information.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.51,0:44:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.62,0:44:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,“无用”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Useless"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:44:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.00,0:45:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可思议 - 漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unreal. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.58,0:45:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 是古堡的平面图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, it's the floor plan of the chateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.81,0:45:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's different somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.98,0:45:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,颠倒乾坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.65,0:45:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,左右互搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.69,0:45:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,连房间都是障眼法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the rooms are tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.56,0:45:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.70,0:45:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.90,0:45:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你真好 - 见到你们真好 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So good to see you. - So good to see you, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.94,0:45:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明明可以看下可视门铃然后给我们开门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've just checked the Ring camera and buzzed us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.67,0:45:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那多没意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where's the fun in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.74,0:45:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 嗨 我是查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. Hi, I'm Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.78,0:45:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是你的超级粉丝 - 嗨 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm such a big fan of yours. - Hi, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.51,0:45:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.85,0:45:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没亲眼见过这么大的鲁伯透镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a Lubor Lens this big in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.02,0:45:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？那你见识的还在后头呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Well, you ain't seen nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.95,0:46:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是你寄的塔罗牌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you sent the tarot cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.75,0:46:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.02,0:46:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我早就不干这种蠢事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I've long since given up such foolishness,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.69,0:46:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不管你们这摊子烂事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your collective dysfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.90,0:46:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我现在只给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the only magic I do nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.23,0:46:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,孙子孙女变魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}is for my grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.37,0:46:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 几周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some weeks ago, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.30,0:46:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有张卡片出现在我家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}a card did appear on my doorstep,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.24,0:46:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告我把古堡准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}warning me to prepare this chateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.28,0:46:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎接七位即将亡命天涯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the arrival of seven soon-to-be fugitives.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.91,0:46:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,通缉犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.11,0:46:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这很合理 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That tracks. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.62,0:46:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 天眼为什么要我们来这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so why does The Eye want us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.42,0:46:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我只能假设无论他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can only assume that whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.99,0:46:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来想让你们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}they want you to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.82,0:46:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,线索都藏在这些墙里\N{\fnArial\fs30}is hidden somewhere in these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.29,0:46:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这座古堡 鲁西永古堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, this chateau, Chateau Roussillon,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.33,0:46:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾是他们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}used to be their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.73,0:46:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,1943 年\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1943,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.30,0:46:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,盟军急需各种军事奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Allies needed military miracles from every source.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.11,0:46:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们招募了当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}They enlisted the aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.57,0:46:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最有才华的一批魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}of some of the most talented magicians of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.68,0:47:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用泥巴 纸板 灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}They built a whole city using mud, cardboard, lights,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.18,0:47:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有数千个充气橡胶坦克造了一整座假城\N{\fnArial\fs30}thousands of inflatable rubber tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.25,0:47:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来迷惑德军\N{\fnArial\fs30}to misdirect the Germans.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.42,0:47:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯帕·马斯基林的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The genius of Jasper Maskelyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.32,0:47:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人很懂历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody knows his history.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.53,0:47:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那纳粹和这钻石有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so, what do the Nazis have to do with the diamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.50,0:47:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.27,0:47:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但答案一定就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the answer is here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.54,0:47:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找找看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.84,0:47:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,范德伯格女士 范德伯格女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Vanderberg.Ms. Vanderberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有传言说您的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you respond to the rumors that your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.31,0:47:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是个洗钱的幌子 您怎么回应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is nothing but a front for money laundering?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.15,0:47:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,四骑士就是一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Horsemen are thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.35,0:47:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装成反资本主义艺人的小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}posing as anti-capitalist entertainers,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.32,0:47:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不公正地针对我和我的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they have unfairly targeted me and my good company.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.55,0:47:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挑战任何诽谤我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I challenge anyone who maligns us to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.39,0:47:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去仔细查我们的运营和帐目\N{\fnArial\fs30}closely at our operations and our books.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.73,0:47:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也挑战警方把那些魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I challenge police to put those magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.46,0:47:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,送回他们该去的地方 过去的历史里\N{\fnArial\fs30}back where they belong, in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.86,0:47:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, no more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.37,0:47:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再问了 拜托 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more questions, please!Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.85,0:48:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际刑警说这是内鬼干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interpol said it was an inside job.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.15,0:48:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃贼确切地知道盲点在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thieves knew exactly where the blind spots were.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.26,0:48:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉如何？ - 让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was it? - Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.33,0:48:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你在背后指使四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one behind these Horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.70,0:48:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那群小马夫的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their little stable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.77,0:48:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我为什么要向你讨要钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why would I ask for the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.07,0:48:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再去偷它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then try to steal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.54,0:48:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我会想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I'd figure out a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.50,0:48:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿回来 越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get it back, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.21,0:48:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你和你的车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that you and your race team.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.94,0:48:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周晚些时候会去阿布扎比\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be in Abu Dhabi later this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.71,0:48:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的中间地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}A perfect neutral ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.68,0:48:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带上证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring my evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.95,0:48:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带上你的“海洋之心”如果你还有心的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring your Heart, if you have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.68,0:48:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.29,0:48:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到他们了吗？ - 我们有几条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you found them yet? - We do have a few leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.96,0:48:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看见他们往南出了比利时\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were seen headed south out of Belgium.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.53,0:48:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的消息是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're saying the Horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.59,0:48:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时前有人在法国看见了四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been seen in France one hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.43,0:48:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国警长欠我个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The head of the French police owes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.26,0:49:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给他 就说我要四骑士的项上人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call him and say that I want these Horsemen's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.50,0:49:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,端在盘子里给我送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}served up on a platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.27,0:49:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,宪兵队会找到他们的 我确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gendarme will find them.I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.04,0:49:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯让我们找东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus told us to look for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.61,0:49:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.18,0:49:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 哇 真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow. This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.72,0:49:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你话不多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not a big talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.29,0:49:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.65,0:49:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你道歉倒是挺勤快\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are a big apologizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.76,0:49:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I just did it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.06,0:49:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我是说… 我只是紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I mean…I'm just nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.09,0:49:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你们的超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a big fan of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.93,0:49:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还把警察招来了 我真的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got the cops called in, and I'm really…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.70,0:49:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的… 我不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really…I'm not gonna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.50,0:49:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.77,0:49:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你们让四骑士看起来很风光\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you guys made the Horsemen look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.27,0:49:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没看见你 你为什么没出镜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't see you.Why weren't you in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.28,0:49:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我只是… 我更喜欢幕后 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just… I prefer to be behind the scenes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.45,0:49:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术都是我设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I design all of our tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.01,0:49:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我们在哪儿？感觉迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, where are we going?I feel like we're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.82,0:49:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的喜欢幕后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really prefer that,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.18,0:49:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是拿它当挡箭牌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or is that just something you hide behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.95,0:49:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.49,0:49:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我… 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I… Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.59,0:50:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来 我告诉自己我想当助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years, I told myself I wanted to be an assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.73,0:50:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意被阿特拉斯抢风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I didn't mind being upstaged by Atlas,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.93,0:50:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他太才华横溢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he's so brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.13,0:50:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实 我只是… 我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really, I just…I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.20,0:50:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕站在聚光灯下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid to take the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.01,0:50:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 萨迪厄斯是对的 颠倒乾坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Thaddeus was right.Up is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.96,0:50:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,颠倒屋 酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upside down room. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.49,0:50:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没点惊叹的感觉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is nothing impressive to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.86,0:50:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才说“酷”啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I said "cool."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.80,0:50:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂“酷”是啥意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not know what cool means?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.57,0:50:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 咱们还是研究下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's just try to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.07,0:50:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房间怎么回事吧 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how this room works, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.50,0:50:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.21,0:50:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.71,0:50:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 没错 你什么都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. That's right.You know everything already.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.35,0:50:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回我又做错什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did I do wrong this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.42,0:50:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 没有 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, nothing. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.78,0:50:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很厉害 看你解谜是种荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're amazing.It's an honor to watch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.15,0:51:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人说过你是个控制狂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone ever told you that you're a control freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.09,0:51:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 好多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.90,0:51:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.73,0:51:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.68,0:51:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.42,0:51:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,软糖劲儿上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gummies kicked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.63,0:51:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想我们要找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.40,0:51:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.10,0:51:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿哪样不奇怪 天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all weird. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.04,0:51:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.74,0:51:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我以前一直很崇拜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I have always looked up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.11,0:52:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.45,0:52:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 在你变成游轮魔术师之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, before you became a cruise ship magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.92,0:52:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我也接企业活动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I also do corporate events.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.65,0:52:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不会吧 看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no way. I couldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.09,0:52:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是白忙活 现在咋办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that was a total waste. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.46,0:52:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个魔术 行吗？别整花活\N{\fnArial\fs30}One trick. Okay? No charm,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.06,0:52:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍嘴皮子 就一个魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}no gifts of gabs.Just one trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.89,0:52:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我没必要向你证明什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I do not have to prove myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.06,0:52:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you kind of do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.23,0:52:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看天眼为什么选你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me why The Eye picked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.57,0:52:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.43,0:52:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明给我看你不需要保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove to me that you don't need a babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.77,0:52:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 怎么现在不演了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what, now you stop performing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.91,0:52:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的那些废柴朋友不在你就没劲儿显摆了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're done showing off 'cause your misfit friends aren't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.14,0:52:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是我的家人 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're my family. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.11,0:52:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许你说他们我不需要取悦他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare.I don't have to impress them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.85,0:52:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.08,0:52:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想看看你不为了博取廉价掌声时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to see what you were capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.35,0:52:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底有多大能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you weren't trying to win cheap applause,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.88,0:52:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜答案是屁能耐没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I guess the answer is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.02,0:52:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 想看魔术是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.You wanna see a magic trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.33,0:52:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 阿特拉斯 你的问题在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the problem with you, Atlas,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.99,0:52:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是把事情搞复杂了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you just like to overcomplicate things, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.86,0:52:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到一颗钻石比你想像的容易多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a lot easier to find a diamond than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.20,0:52:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 让它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh. - And to make it…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:52:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.10,0:53:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 漂亮 - 摸摸你口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice. - Check your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.61,0:53:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.67,0:53:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.34,0:53:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不赖 “卡牌转移到不可能的位置”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, not bad.Card to impossible location.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.28,0:53:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别在棋盘上玩跳棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't play checkers on a chessboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.78,0:53:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我已经领先你五步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm already five steps ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.95,0:53:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸摸你口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.69,0:53:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.95,0:53:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些可是无价古董 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Those are priceless antiques. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.66,0:53:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房间是旧文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This room is where old relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.46,0:53:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的安息之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to their final resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.23,0:53:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你大概… 大概是对的 萨迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. You are, uh… You're probably right, Thaddeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.90,0:53:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那之前 它们得有最后一次闪光的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, not before they have one last shot at glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.87,0:53:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是干嘛呢？ - 挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on here? - Pretty good,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.30,0:53:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你应该试着慢一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you should try to do things a little more slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.20,0:53:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.34,0:53:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的观众享受真正的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let your audience enjoy the real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.74,0:53:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.98,0:53:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不赖 不赖 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- not bad. Not bad. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.08,0:53:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 博斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one, Bosco.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.31,0:53:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扑克一直玩得不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been great at poker,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.98,0:53:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但方片（钻石）能赢红桃吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but is a diamond trumped by a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.35,0:53:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 在这儿呢 呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. There it is.Whoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.55,0:53:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,障眼法不错 但别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice misdirection, but, let's not forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.92,0:53:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这到底是关于什么的 - 我还没完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what this is really about. - I wasn't done.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.56,0:53:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他看看 查理 - 把宝石变没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show 'em, Charlie. - Making a jewel disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.49,0:53:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来看看这个 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see this one. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.80,0:53:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着宝物别眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eye on the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.00,0:54:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,转啊转 转啊转 停在哪儿 谁知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round and round they go, where they stop, nobody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.83,0:54:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good as gone.Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.17,0:54:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑背景魔术 桌子有机关 我进来就看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black art, table's rigged, saw it when I came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.07,0:54:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该彻底消失了 - 噢 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time for a clean escape. - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.34,0:54:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪了？我知道他在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he going?I know what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.18,0:54:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩偶盒？这也是魔术？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack in the box? That's a trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.62,0:54:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 老掉牙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's old stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.85,0:54:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道这么容易就把他弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had known he was that easy to get rid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.29,0:54:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没那么容易 - 是啊 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not that easy. - Yeah, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.96,0:54:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 行了 暖场结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! Okay, enough of the warm-up act,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.56,0:54:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,主角该登场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}time for the headliner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你想一张牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to think of one of these cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.26,0:54:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别想那张你以为我想让你想的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't think of the one you think I want you to think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.37,0:54:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想好了吗？ 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got one? Yeah, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.44,0:54:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的牌是？红桃 4\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your card? Four of hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.91,0:54:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.27,0:54:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮 教授 佩服 佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one, professor.I'm impressed. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.24,0:54:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 那威士忌比你岁数还大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey. Hey.That whiskey is older than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.58,0:54:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 老板 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, boss. So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.48,0:54:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 各位 我不撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you guys, I'm not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.15,0:54:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has been really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.55,0:54:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的真的酷 - 给他们瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really, really cool. - Go show 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.09,0:54:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我想让它更酷一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, I think I just want to make it a little cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.49,0:54:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 耶 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on now, yeah!-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.99,0:55:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了 - 耶 中国雪暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she goes. - Yes! Snow storm in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.00,0:55:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了 真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we are. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冬天总穿白色 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wear white in winter, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.77,0:55:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在法国这地方雪很少见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow is rare in this part of France,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.47,0:55:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 真冰那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, ice, that is just impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.64,0:55:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,经典 漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classic. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.98,0:55:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把消失变得这么好看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do a vanish so good?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.51,0:55:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 魔术师从不泄密 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, a magician never tells. - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.11,0:55:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 嗯 - 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh. Hmm. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.32,0:55:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,死局？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.49,0:55:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.49,0:55:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 博斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, Bosco.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.99,0:55:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,智慧和技巧永远胜过年轻气盛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisdom and skill overcome youth and arrogance every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.16,0:55:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.69,0:55:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别自以为是屋里最聪明的人 证明它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never assume you're the smartest guy in the room. Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.79,0:55:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 老兄 你什么都没证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break, man.You didn't prove anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.96,0:55:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我能提醒各位吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I just remind everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.13,0:55:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}we still haven't figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.37,0:55:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么会在这堆二战老古董里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why we're even in this World War II relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.63,0:55:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.97,0:55:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯帕·马斯基林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper Maskelyne,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.20,0:55:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个… 击败了纳粹的魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}the… the magician who vanquished the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.41,0:55:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他造了假城市 假坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He built fake cities, fake tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.94,0:55:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说… 我在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… I wonder…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.16,0:56:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.46,0:56:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.86,0:56:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我对了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, I was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.50,0:56:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 魔术入门第一课 老兄 当魔术成功时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Magic 101, man, never act surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.40,0:56:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别表现得像很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the trick actually works.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.97,0:56:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.88,0:56:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 天啊 - 这些都是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my goodness. - What is all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.85,0:56:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹战犯百科全书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Encyclopedia of Nazi war criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.91,0:56:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 显然包括了维罗妮卡的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, which apparently includes Veronika's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.25,0:56:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,二战后 幸存的纳粹分子逃往世界各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}After World War II, surviving Nazis fled around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.05,0:56:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是会计 但看起来皮特·范德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an accountant, but looks like Peter Vanderberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.62,0:56:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是靠帮他们洗黑钱发家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}got rich cleaning their dirty money.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.39,0:56:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 显然维罗妮卡接手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and apparently Veronika took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.36,0:56:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用他的犯罪网络继续作恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}right where he left off using his criminal network.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.26,0:56:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但… 但我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.66,0:56:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼让我们拿这个干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does The Eye want us to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.57,0:56:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果我没猜错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I'm not mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.97,0:56:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼想让我们揭开范德伯格家族的面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eye wants us to unmask the Vanderbergs,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.74,0:56:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一个魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring down two generations of criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.04,0:56:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁这个两代犯罪家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a single sleight of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.68,0:57:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在网上读到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read some interesting rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.08,0:57:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于范德伯格的一些有趣传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the Vanderbergs online.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.21,0:57:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说 15 年前 维罗妮卡的母亲自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like 15 years ago, Veronika's mom killed herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.55,0:57:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周后 他们管家的车刹车失灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a week later, their housekeeper's brakes failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.09,0:57:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,车毁人亡 管家和她儿子都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her car crashed, she and her son died.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.22,0:57:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人怀疑是谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some suspicion of foul play,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.13,0:57:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一直没证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing was ever proven.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.26,0:57:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.63,0:57:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.64,0:57:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.71,0:57:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.88,0:57:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen closely. Split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.08,0:57:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找路出去 快 快 - 好 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find a way out. Go. Go. - Okay. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.05,0:57:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对 大家散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.Everybody split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.40,0:57:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.50,0:57:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进来了 正在寻找钻石
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.00,0:57:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不复杂 只有地滚球那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.97,0:57:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始搜 别光站着
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.50,0:57:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人一组 用无线电联络
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.47,0:57:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要找到
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.14,0:57:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.11,0:58:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.18,0:58:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转过去 - 转过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn around. - Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.28,0:58:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他的 博斯科 转过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him, Bosco.Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.33,0:58:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.58,0:58:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这呢 蠢猪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.99,0:58:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adios, mon ami.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.30,0:59:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.38,0:59:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.50,0:59:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.00,0:59:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 先生 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonjour, monsieur. Bonjour.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.42,0:59:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 通常 我喜欢给新客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, normally, I like to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.16,0:59:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好导览一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}a proper tour to new guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.73,0:59:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你已经发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect you've discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.66,0:59:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这所房子藏着许多秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this house holds many secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.20,0:59:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.01,0:59:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.94,0:59:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看个魔术吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to see a magic trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.00,0:59:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.78,0:59:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我让自己…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about if I make myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.72,0:59:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失？\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.35,0:59:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.45,0:59:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.02,0:59:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.75,1:00:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.70,1:00:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我搜
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.05,1:00:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑不远
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.81,1:00:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.60,1:00:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.55,1:00:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手抱头
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.12,1:00:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.12,1:00:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.09,1:00:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.29,1:00:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 离开这儿最快的路是哪条？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, which is the fastest way out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.06,1:00:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绕过这个弯… - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Around this bend… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.26,1:00:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条密道\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a passageway.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.43,1:00:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着小溪穿过树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow the creek through the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.67,1:00:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.07,1:00:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 不不不 不不不 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.47,1:00:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧？来 萨迪厄斯 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.Come on, Thaddeus, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.51,1:00:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.61,1:00:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得带你去治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.28,1:00:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.11,1:00:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须阻止维罗妮卡·范德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop Veronika Vanderberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.78,1:00:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有你我们做不到 萨迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't do it without you, Thaddeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.45,1:01:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.69,1:01:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们需要彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do need each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.46,1:01:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别忘了这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.03,1:01:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来的时候就知道这会是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew when I came here, this was…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.94,1:01:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably my final trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.78,1:01:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我白死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't let me die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.38,1:01:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's work to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.46,1:01:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走 走 求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go now, go. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.73,1:01:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁还…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.26,1:01:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.55,1:02:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.52,1:02:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.82,1:02:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察抓了琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police took June into custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.72,1:02:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那杰克和梅里特呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about Jack and Merritt?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.45,1:02:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也被抓了 - 好吧 我们去劫狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Them, too. - Okay, so we break them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.55,1:02:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 先讨论一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, uh-uh. Let's just talk about this for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.06,1:02:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨论什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.12,1:02:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我们得放聪明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.We need to be smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.29,1:02:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我得把朋友救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We gotta get my friend out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.09,1:02:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博斯科… - 听着 当你调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bosco… - Look, when you were researching.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.53,1:02:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的背景时 你知道什么没查出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that stuff about us, you know what didn't come up?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.03,1:02:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理和琼是我唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie and June are my only friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.60,1:02:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我为什么喜欢他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I really love about them?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.04,1:02:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们不会让我觉得自己是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't make me feel like an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.74,1:03:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去救琼 - 博斯科 等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm getting June. - Bosco, wait…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.04,1:03:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 嘿 - 就一秒 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to me. Hey. - Just one second, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.77,1:03:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.88,1:03:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.91,1:03:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在通缉你 博斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for you, Bosco.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.21,1:03:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在通缉我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.58,1:03:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没错 你也得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, you're gonna get arrested, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.45,1:03:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.45,1:03:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠 - 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.75,1:03:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是还有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only there was somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.92,1:03:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也疯到在没有资源没有保护的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}crazy enough to stage a jailbreak.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.22,1:03:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,策划一场劫狱就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no resources, no protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.65,1:03:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿特拉斯 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Atlas. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.49,1:03:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.25,1:44:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs16\fad（700，500）}字幕制作：{\fs20\c&H4080FF&}leslie727{\fs20\c&HFFFFFF&}\h\h&\h\h{\fs20\1c&HFF8646&\3c&HAE1C14&\bord10\blur10}葫 芦 {\fs16\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1\blur0}Q群：{\fs20\1c&HFF8646&\3c&HAE1C14&\bord10\blur10}491019388
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.41,1:03:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨迪厄斯·马库斯·布拉德利 如果你想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus Marcus Bradley, in case you're interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.75,1:03:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才被你谋杀的人叫什么的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the name of the man you just murdered.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.68,1:03:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.75,1:03:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.52,1:03:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 这事刚开始的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when this whole thing started,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.86,1:03:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你和你那破钻石一点也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't give a shit about you or your diamond,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.86,1:04:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你非要把它变成私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you just went and made it deeply personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.80,1:04:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我真的很期待能把你搞垮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, I am really looking forward to taking you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.51,1:04:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲肯定会很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father would have loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.54,1:04:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常喜欢魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was quite fond of magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.45,1:04:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我五六岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was five or six,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.01,1:04:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他少数几个只属于我的时刻里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in one of the few moments that I had him to myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.42,1:04:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教了我一个魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}he taught me a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.02,1:04:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会让一条红色丝绸手帕消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would make a red silk handkerchief disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.59,1:04:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后从嘴里吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then come back out of his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.36,1:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.29,1:04:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那范儿拿捏得恰到好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had just the right amount of flair.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.86,1:04:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我练那个魔术练了好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I practiced that trick for months.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.96,1:04:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想只要我表演得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that if I could do it just right,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.53,1:04:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能赢得他更多的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would earn more of…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.70,1:04:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.91,1:04:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was the illusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.64,1:04:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那以后我就讨厌魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hated magic ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.58,1:04:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些浮夸 俗套的东西 更别提像你这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The camp, the cheese, not to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.51,1:04:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩读心术的骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}of con artists like you with your mentalism.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.39,1:04:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都没有超能力 麦金尼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither one of us has psychic powers, Mr. McKinney.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.16,1:05:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也不需要 你知道我的“海洋之心”在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't have to.You know where my Heart is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.39,1:05:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't have to,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.06,1:05:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你会告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're going to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.03,1:05:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你足够聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're smart enough to know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.23,1:05:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道用我们德州话说就是 我屁都不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't telling you shit, as we say in Texas.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.60,1:05:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 关于读心术你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you're wrong about mentalism.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.01,1:05:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们把整个人生故事都写在了脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}People wear their entire life story on their face.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.94,1:05:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要知道怎么读\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to know how to read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.45,1:05:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿你的来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take yours, for example.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.45,1:05:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以吗？ - 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I? - With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.42,1:05:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.02,1:05:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you've already shared,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.22,1:05:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常痛苦详细地 分享了你缺父爱的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}in excruciating detail, your daddy issues,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.86,1:05:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很好奇你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm curious about your mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.07,1:05:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么要自杀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did she commit suicide?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.80,1:05:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she as desperate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.11,1:05:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝望地渴望你父亲的关注吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your father's attention as you were?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.94,1:05:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.28,1:05:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.38,1:05:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.08,1:06:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你父亲把关注给了别人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your father give his attention to someone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.79,1:06:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把头发撩到耳后 那就是破绽\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you tuck your hair behind your ear, that's a tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.56,1:06:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.26,1:06:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 他是跟秘书搞上了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, was he banging his secretary?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.60,1:06:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那太俗套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's too cliche.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.24,1:06:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是个和你妈妈很亲近的人才会让她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it had to be someone close to your mom for her to…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.97,1:06:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好朋友？理发师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good friend? Hairdresser?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.18,1:06:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该不会是管家吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't the housekeeper, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.38,1:06:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not the housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.32,1:06:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空跟你废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.42,1:06:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我说对了的时候人们都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what people usually say when I'm getting hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.26,1:06:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要把空调开大点 或者开个窗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we crank up the AC, maybe open a window?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.36,1:06:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果我爸跟管家有一腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if my dad was having sex with my housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.76,1:06:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈发现后自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my mom found out and committed suicide,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.90,1:06:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概不会去弄坏管家那辆车的刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably wouldn't cut the brakes on my housekeeper's car.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.64,1:06:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 我又不是变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then again, I'm not a psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.15,1:07:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个可悲又可怜的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a sad and pathetic man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.05,1:07:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你为什么要自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see why you want to end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.32,1:07:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 嘿 那个 维罗妮卡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hey, uh, Veronika…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.95,1:07:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.02,1:07:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃跑也是破绽\N{\fnArial\fs30}walking away is also a tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.50,1:07:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}局长 我在公园里抓到这个老巫婆
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.30,1:07:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}她喝得酩酊大醉 怎么处理？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.55,1:07:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFF&}我能把你喝趴下 蠢猪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.90,1:07:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}把她关进去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.23,1:07:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFF&}蠢猪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.85,1:07:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔啦啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh-la-la.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.60,1:07:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFF&}这间是我的？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.80,1:07:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFF&}我要海景房
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.90,1:07:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 先生 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur, monsieur, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.30,1:08:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFF&}呜 他好可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.50,1:08:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FFFF&}快走…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.90,1:08:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为这位囚犯负全责
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.30,1:08:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,范德伯格女士 无意冒犯 我不能…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.90,1:08:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们不能再处理她了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.92,1:08:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长 那个老巫婆的胳膊断了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.48,1:08:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.92,1:08:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须叫救护车
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.92,1:08:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的胳膊断了 正在耷拉着 局长
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.95,1:08:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪去了？那个女孩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.32,1:08:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.60,1:08:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.16,1:08:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.95,1:08:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那个女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.97,1:09:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonsoir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.64,1:09:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太恶心了 就算是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty disgusting, even for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.48,1:09:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能酒喝多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I may have overdone it on the wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.15,1:09:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 露拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Lula.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.69,1:09:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 你气色不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.09,1:09:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 第一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.79,1:09:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为再也见不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think I'd ever see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.59,1:09:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find us?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.10,1:09:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给我报信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little birdie told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.47,1:09:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我多惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine my surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.63,1:09:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们居然撇下我重组了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys all got back together without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.17,1:09:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不 不是那样 你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, it's not like that.You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't? No?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.04,1:09:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自由了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free. Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.28,1:09:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,救兵到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.95,1:09:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想我吗？ - 噢 想死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss me? - Oh, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.95,1:09:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你好啊 我是露拉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello there.It's me, Lula…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.15,1:09:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大牙 露拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teeth! Lula!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.46,1:09:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？我曾经也是四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember?I too was once a Horseman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.16,1:10:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我问过你 我是唯一问起你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I asked about you.I was the only one.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.56,1:10:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你是唯… 他是唯一问起的人？真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you were the…He was the only one. Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.00,1:10:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.50,1:10:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.64,1:10:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去汇合点 计划是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to the meet-up.Okay, here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.74,1:10:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞到了逃逸车 一切就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the getaway car. It's all ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.01,1:10:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要杰克去接线打火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need Jack to hotwire it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.45,1:10:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你的计划是让我去偷车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, your plan is for me to steal a car?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.15,1:10:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.35,1:10:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去打火 你去找琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll hotwire the car.You get June.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.08,1:10:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要带上她 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not leave without her, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.25,1:10:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外面汇合 - 好好好 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meet us outside. - Yeah, yeah, yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.02,1:10:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 注意闪烁的警灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Uh, watch for flashing lights!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.59,1:10:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我可以接线…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You know, I can hotwire the…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.05,1:10:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以放开我了 - 好 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can let go of me now. - Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.70,1:11:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.75,1:11:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实点 小孩
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.00,1:11:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ {\c&HFFFFFF&}Oui-Oui（A Canadian in Paris） - Pulsallama {\c&HFFDB00&}♪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.18,1:11:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 法兰西万岁 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Viva la France ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.68,1:11:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我爱薯条和吐司 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I love the fries and the toast ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.73,1:11:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.96,1:11:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the diamond?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.80,1:11:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里特 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merritt, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.30,1:11:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我保护你 小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your back, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.44,1:11:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁来保护你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who's got yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.80,1:11:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪烁的灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flashing lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.27,1:11:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.78,1:12:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.88,1:12:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,注视并思考为何我的低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}watch and wonder why I whisper words.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.55,1:12:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,削弱了你的意志 然后 睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}that weaken your will, and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.12,1:12:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不是对谁都管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone's susceptible.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.80,1:12:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 “睡 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Sleep!"
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.88,1:12:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy does it s'il vous plait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.58,1:12:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.46,1:12:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.67,1:12:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.17,1:12:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该早告诉我们你是坐警车来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have told us you were coming in a police car.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.14,1:12:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.67,1:13:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我们让第五位骑士重现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, look, we made the Fifth Horseman reappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.54,1:13:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 露拉 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Lula. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.07,1:13:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.34,1:13:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧？ - 没事 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah. No, I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.35,1:13:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但他们抓了梅里特 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But they have Merritt. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.58,1:13:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 我跑了 他没跑掉 - 好了好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I escaped, he couldn't. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.68,1:13:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都挺激动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very emotional time for everybody here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.59,1:13:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然发生了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly a lot going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.09,1:13:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也尽量不往心里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm really trying not to take any of this personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.42,1:13:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但能不能告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, please, can you tell me,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.36,1:13:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼直接联系你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did The Eye contact you directly?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.66,1:13:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.70,1:13:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也是？ - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You, too? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.00,1:13:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么不早给我打电话？ - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you call me sooner? - I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.97,1:13:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得找保姆啊 - 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had to find a babysitter. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.50,1:13:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切发生得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything happened like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.83,1:13:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 抱歉 你们认识？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, sorry.You two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.34,1:13:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 认识 - 当然认识…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah, we know…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.64,1:13:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many female magicians do you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.87,1:13:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少女魔术师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are in the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.41,1:13:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这屋里居然能有三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact there are three of us in the room right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.94,1:13:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惊人了 惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking. Shocking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.24,1:13:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简直不可思议 - 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's, like, mind blown. - That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.74,1:13:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙居然没因此坍缩 真让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised the universe isn't folding in on itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.58,1:13:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是说啊 - 阿布扎比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly. - Abu Dhabi!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.28,1:13:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他一直这样吗？ - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does he just do that? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.12,1:13:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我… 我是你的超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I just… I'm a big fan of yours, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.45,1:13:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才在查维罗妮卡下一步去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to figure out where Veronika was gonna be next.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.19,1:13:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 范德伯格集团有一支赛车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, apparently, Vanderberg Global has a motorsports team.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.69,1:13:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周末要在阿布扎比发布新车\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're introducing a new car this weekend in Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.96,1:14:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们可以把梅里特救回来 顺便揭露她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can get Merritt back and expose her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.10,1:14:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.17,1:14:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我不揭露她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.I am not exposing her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.37,1:14:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不揭露任何人 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not exposing anyone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.57,1:14:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管天眼想干嘛 不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what The Eye wants. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.20,1:14:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用这个换梅里特 然后就收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are swapping this for Merritt, and then we are done.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.04,1:14:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们救朋友 不救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're saving our friend, we're not saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.54,1:14:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？ - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then what? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.91,1:14:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就回去过日子让她逍遥法外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just go back to our lives and let her walk away?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.44,1:14:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯那次之后你说过 “魔术师是艺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Russia, you said, "Magicians are entertainers,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.55,1:14:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “不是超级英雄” - 天啊 又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "not superheroes."-Oh, my God. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.98,1:14:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在觉得你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm starting to think that you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.38,1:14:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不像她父亲那样只洗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't just launder money like her father.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.08,1:14:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到萨迪厄斯的下场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what happened to Thaddeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.89,1:14:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 我有点跟不上节奏了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, I'm playing a bit of catch-up here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.25,1:14:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有掌握全部信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have all of the information,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.66,1:14:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不妨碍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't think that that should stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.73,1:14:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,发表一下对下一步行动的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}from having an opinion about what we do next.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.73,1:14:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确实妨碍 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course it should. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.89,1:14:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妨碍 阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it shouldn't, Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.00,1:14:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该揭露凡妮莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we should expose Vanessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.06,1:14:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维罗妮卡 - 维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Veronika. - Veronika.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.13,1:14:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭露她谋杀和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For murder and…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.33,1:14:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另一件事是什么？ - 洗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is the other thing? - Money laundering.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.43,1:14:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和洗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for money laundering.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.50,1:14:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀和洗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For murder and for money laundering.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.17,1:14:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 没错 - 我们应该把她绑起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah. - We should tie her up…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.61,1:14:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! It is too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.64,1:14:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿特拉斯说得对 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Atlas is right. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.94,1:14:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不牺牲自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are done sacrificing ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.01,1:14:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 抱歉 不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I'm sorry. It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.18,1:14:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.65,1:14:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.08,1:14:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我错了？ - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I? - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.08,1:14:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别道歉 说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't be sorry. Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.22,1:14:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是错了 你错了 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.You're wrong. It's just…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.99,1:15:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在发现四骑士之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I discovered the Horsemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.69,1:15:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对什么都不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't give a shit about anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.26,1:15:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我的家人抛弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… My family gave me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.20,1:15:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我憎恨整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.50,1:15:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我看到了你们的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, I saw a video of you guys,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.47,1:15:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们试图让这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were trying to make the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.11,1:15:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得不那么腐败 不那么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}less corrupt, less terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.68,1:15:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我重新燃起了希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that made me give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.56,1:15:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术怎么玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the trick?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.89,1:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise this is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.53,1:15:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这足以转移注意力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is that enough misdirection?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.16,1:15:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要她人在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as she's here and not there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.37,1:15:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.70,1:15:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你们只晚了五分钟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're even just five minutes late…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.64,1:15:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五分钟？我看一分钟都不行 - 迟到一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five? I'd say one. - One minute late.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.81,1:15:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道会有足够多的人到场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know enough people are gonna show up?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.87,1:15:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这消息已经传疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, it's already viral.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.58,1:15:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会人山人海\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guarantee there'll be a crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.51,1:15:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了 变数太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nuts.There's too many variables.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.75,1:15:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们会一直跟你们保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we'll be in constant contact with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.38,1:15:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果出了差错… - 嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if something goes awry… - Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.98,1:16:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿没有任何犯错的馀地 明白吗？零容错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, like, no margin for error here, man. Okay? Zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.89,1:16:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须做到完美无缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have to be absolutely flawless.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.69,1:16:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想在这短得离谱的时间内\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're gonna pull something this risky off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.52,1:16:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定这么多环节\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this many moving parts.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.06,1:16:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成这么高风险的任务 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this ridiculously short amount of time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.86,1:16:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.06,1:16:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 至少代表我自己说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}But speaking for myself, at least,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.86,1:16:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们七个人联手胜算比谁都大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the seven of us have a better chance than most.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.73,1:16:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.27,1:16:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.07,1:16:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的博斯科·勒罗伊什么时候变温柔了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did the great Bosco Leroy go soft?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.74,1:16:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位 这票干还是不干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, are we doing this or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.08,1:16:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是千万分之一的机率\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a ten million to one shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.91,1:16:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢这种机率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are my kind of odds.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.19,1:16:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.56,1:16:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉时已到\N{\fnArial\fs30}the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.73,1:16:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 仅此一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, for one night only.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.06,1:16:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凑近点 再近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in close.Closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.40,1:16:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\i0}阿联酋 - 阿布扎比
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.20,1:16:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你自以为看清的越多…\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause the more you think you see…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.27,1:16:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越容易被蒙骗过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The easier it will be to fool you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.71,1:16:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.21,1:16:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需两小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In only two hours,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.64,1:16:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,四骑士将再次同台\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Four Horsemen will be on stage together.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.24,1:17:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是十年来的第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the first time in ten years.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.41,1:17:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,J·丹尼尔·阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}J. Daniel Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.42,1:17:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·里维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henley Reeves.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.36,1:17:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·怀尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.77,1:17:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有露拉·梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lula May.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.44,1:17:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, the Four Horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.98,1:17:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 四骑士回归仅此一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, the Horsemen are back for one night only.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.45,1:17:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周 我们偷走了海洋之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, last week, we stole the Heart Diamond,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.82,1:17:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 两小时后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tonight, in two hours' time,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.32,1:17:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把它物归原主\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're going to return it to its rightful owner,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.29,1:17:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.76,1:17:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这引起她注意了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that got her attention?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.26,1:17:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要不行 我也没辙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that didn't, I don't know what will.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.63,1:17:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 现在你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, now that you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.70,1:17:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情会有多糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how bad things can actually get,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.16,1:17:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能就这一次稳一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you please just try playing it safe this one time?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.07,1:17:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能 - 行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.20,1:17:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.04,1:18:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了 真准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here she is. Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.67,1:18:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,演出好看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You enjoying the show?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.04,1:18:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 对我来说有点俗气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, it's a little tacky for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.54,1:18:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你把场地选在这是因为离我很近吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you chose your venue for its proximity to my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.88,1:18:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 告诉你个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good news for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.31,1:18:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把你列入宾客名单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've placed you on our guest list.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.32,1:18:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上我的海洋之心 我们来做个交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me my Heart.We'll make an exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.79,1:18:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用麦金尼先生换钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McKinney for the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.82,1:18:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼 - 在外面 灯光下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. - Outside, under the lights,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.63,1:18:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍任何魔术花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not the first hint of magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.53,1:18:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是帽子里蹦出个兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}One rabbit comes out of a hat,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.56,1:18:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者袖子里滑出张牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}one ace slides out of a sleeve,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.87,1:18:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友就会“嘭”的一声 没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your friend goes poof.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.20,1:18:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想用点你能听懂的术语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to use parlance you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.00,1:18:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ {\an7\c&HFFFFFF&}Abracadabra - Lady Gaga {\c&HFFDB00&}♪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.31,1:18:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 阿布拉卡达布拉… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Abracadabra, amor-oo-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.54,1:18:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 阿布拉卡达布拉… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Abracadabra Morta-oo-ga-ga ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.55,1:18:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 阿布拉卡达布拉… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Abracadabra, abra-oo-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.15,1:18:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 她说着 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ In her tongue she said ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.52,1:18:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ “今晚不是死就是爱” ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ "Death or love tonight" ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.36,1:18:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 阿布拉卡达布拉 阿布拉卡达布拉 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Abracadabra, abracadabra ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.60,1:19:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 阿布拉卡达布拉 阿布拉卡达布拉… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Abracadabra Abracadabra… ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.20,1:19:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到亚斯岛 W 酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the W Yas Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.44,1:19:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,中东的奥兰多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Orlando of the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.24,1:19:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.08,1:19:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, finally,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.41,1:19:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢亚斯岛举办了一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you to Yas Island for hosting an event.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.55,1:19:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,配得上赛车界最快车队的活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}worthy of the fastest team in motorsport.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.92,1:19:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条赛道是顶级的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This track is elite,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.89,1:19:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它很快就会让我们的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it will soon provide our competitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.95,1:19:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到赛车中最常见的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the most common view in racing,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.76,1:19:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们的车尾灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rear wings of our cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.56,1:19:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.06,1:19:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那是维罗妮卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit. That's Veronika?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.93,1:19:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她气场很强啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a very commanding presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.60,1:19:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的魔术朋友到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our magical friends have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.24,1:19:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去招呼他们一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go and greet them?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.77,1:19:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢光临 希望你们喜欢比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for coming.I hope you enjoy the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.44,1:19:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 阿特拉斯说要制造混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Atlas said to create a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.61,1:19:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么搞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.21,1:19:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is security everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.92,1:19:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别慌 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you guys, calm down.I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.65,1:19:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.15,1:19:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 大卫 酷 我是媒体公关部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, David. Cool.I'm from media relations.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.32,1:19:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是来确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just checking in.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.92,1:20:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能不能换个机位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you guys could do a different camera placement?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.59,1:20:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢了 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thanks. Continue.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.99,1:20:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.30,1:20:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.76,1:20:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.67,1:20:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,务必确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.23,1:20:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石的真伪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the authenticity of the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.94,1:20:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮人诡计多端\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are very tricky.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.27,1:20:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.84,1:20:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要不言归于好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we bury the hatchet?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.84,1:20:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往彼此脖子上砍那种？ - 哈 他真幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In each other's necks? - Ha! He's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.98,1:20:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们各自拥有对方想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We each possess something beneficial to the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.35,1:20:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,做生意的完美理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect reason to do business.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.02,1:20:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一点警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only, there's one caveat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.49,1:20:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热切希望我们的交集到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fervently hope our mutual dealings are at a close.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.79,1:20:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她真淡定 - 别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's so poised. - Not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.49,1:20:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我恨她… 呃 - 露拉 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate her… Ugh. - Lula. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.29,1:20:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？ - 哥们 有事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going? - Bro, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.03,1:20:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们要拍这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're here to shoot the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.66,1:20:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 证件？ - 噢 对 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ID? - Oh, right. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.97,1:20:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的 给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.50,1:20:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的呢？ - 呃 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you? - Uh, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.44,1:20:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我夹克里\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's in my jacket somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.84,1:20:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.11,1:20:51.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,我们是《方格旗》摄制组的 拍纪录片的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with Checkered Flags, the doc series.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.38,1:20:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一季拍范德伯格车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next season's on Vanderberg Motorsports.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.81,1:20:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们居然没通知你们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seriously didn't give you guys a heads-up?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.45,1:20:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.11,1:20:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要拍点插入镜头 可能还要点空镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna get some inserts, maybe some B-roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.55,1:21:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有围观这辆豪车的人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some party people gawking at this beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.05,1:21:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 只要你… - 喂 别碰车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, whenever you're… - Oi, don't touch the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.02,1:21:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得拍内饰 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got to shoot the interior. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.66,1:21:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至可以让你在片子里露个脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can actually get you a cameo in this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.32,1:21:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 省省吧 我有命令在身 - 是啊 我们也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Save it. I've got my orders. - Yeah, and so do we.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.49,1:21:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 范德伯格女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Ms. Vanderberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.00,1:21:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们正要拍您要的素材\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're trying to get that footage you asked for,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.70,1:21:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但遇到了一点小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we ran into a little bit of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.07,1:21:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要有麻烦了 - 她要跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna be in trouble. - She wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.17,1:21:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙啊 老兄 啧啧 不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good, my guy.Mm-mm. Not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.24,1:21:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.81,1:21:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我父亲常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, my father always said.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.84,1:21:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会买没见过的钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one buys a diamond sight unseen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.85,1:21:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而此时此刻 我的车就是那颗钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at this very moment, my car is the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.22,1:21:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 要么让他们干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you can either let them do their job,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.82,1:21:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么你自己另谋高就\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can find yourself a new one.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.72,1:21:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉耽误了 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for the hold-up, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.06,1:21:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事了 - 你最棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're good. - You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.73,1:21:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦稍微退后一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could just back up for me really quick?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.83,1:21:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了光线 谢了兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for the light. Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.77,1:21:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shall we get on with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.24,1:21:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.37,1:21:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 当然 你带了打手 原谅我的冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Of course, you have a goon. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.71,1:22:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 拜托 你不信我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, come on, you don't trust us?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.11,1:22:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了这么多事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all we've been through?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.09,1:22:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.02,1:22:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定的话再仔细查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double check if you're not certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.22,1:22:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是海洋之心 - 当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the Heart. - Yes, of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.22,1:22:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 拜托 能把朋友还给我们了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please, can you get our friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.43,1:22:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.57,1:22:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.63,1:22:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.37,1:22:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呼 - 没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whew. - You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.71,1:22:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然知道我值五亿美元了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that I know I'm worth half a billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.91,1:22:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们还是亏了 不过见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think we got ripped off, but it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.61,1:22:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,板上钉钉 这就交货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signed, sealed, delivered.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.44,1:22:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我是个守信用的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm a woman of my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.75,1:22:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,想留下来也行 享受派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around if you want, enjoy the party.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.92,1:22:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.32,1:22:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in God's name?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.72,1:22:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.39,1:22:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 这玩意怎么开啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, how do you make this thing go?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.33,1:22:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么吼我我没法集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't concentrate with you yelling at me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.40,1:22:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.77,1:22:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.57,1:23:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the police!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.67,1:23:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,演出好看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You enjoying the show?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.27,1:23:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是打算傻站着看还是去把我的车追回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna stand there gawking or get my car back?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.21,1:23:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.02,1:23:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.05,1:23:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 阿特拉斯 你想要混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Atlas, you wanted a distraction,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.42,1:23:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.63,1:23:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这玩意甩尾太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this thing is tail happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.93,1:23:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天 什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.87,1:23:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们掉进活板门里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fell through a trapdoor or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.87,1:23:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.11,1:23:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是哪儿？ - 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.38,1:23:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上醒来时 除了我的钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I woke up this morning, there was only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.68,1:23:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一想要的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted more than my diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.71,1:23:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把四骑士关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Horsemen under lock and key.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.15,1:23:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我两者兼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that I have both,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.49,1:23:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认 我都要被宠坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must admit, I'm feeling a little bit spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.72,1:23:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们准备那点小把戏的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you were prepping your little performance,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.82,1:23:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也策划了一个我自己的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I curated a trick of my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.16,1:23:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,困住五位骑士 无处可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five Horsemen trapped, no escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.00,1:24:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们五个或许是国家宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You five may be national treasures,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.17,1:24:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们这儿也有宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have those here, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.33,1:24:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是很难找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only they're hard to find,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.57,1:24:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它们被埋在沙子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they're buried in sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.58,1:24:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对世人来说 你们死于\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the world, it will appear you died.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.64,1:24:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次失败的逃生表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a failed escape act.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.01,1:24:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 让我们见识下魔术吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's see some magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.05,1:24:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的魔术 快叫增援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck magic!Somebody call for backup!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.19,1:24:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 打给琼 - 谁有信号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, call June. - Anyone have service?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.36,1:24:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 她肯定屏蔽了手机信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, she must have scrambled the cell signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.09,1:24:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她算无遗策啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thought of everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.39,1:24:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,露拉 你到底哪头的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lula, whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.10,1:24:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然是我们这头的 但她确实算无遗策\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on our side, obviously, but she also thought of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.40,1:24:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两点又不冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both things can be true at one time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.90,1:24:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙子越来越高了 沙子越来越多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sand is getting higher.The sand is getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.93,1:24:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙子多了 体积也大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more sand and it's getting larger.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.50,1:24:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 亨利 逃生第一原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henley, Henley, uh, first principle of escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.50,1:24:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 生存时间还有多久？对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, how long is it survivable? Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.71,1:24:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好 根据流速判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Great. Judging from the rate of the flow,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.51,1:24:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子的体积…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the volume of the box…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.84,1:24:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃 完了 我们死定了 - 噢 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, yeah, we're screwed. - Oh, amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.35,1:24:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那逃生第二原则呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, how about the second principle of escape then?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.51,1:24:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是关于箱子本身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so that's the box itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.01,1:24:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有缺陷吗？有弱点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a flaw?Is there a weakness?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.25,1:24:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有后门吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a back door?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.35,1:24:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody just needs to check!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.19,1:24:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边封死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This side's sealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.39,1:24:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 不 封死了 封死了 封死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. No, it's sealed, sealed, sealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.36,1:25:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都封死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's sealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.46,1:25:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有第三原则？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance there's a third principle?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.91,1:25:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有你要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have what you're after.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.24,1:25:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.48,1:25:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在“海洋之心”的归处等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will meet you where the Heart resides.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.78,1:25:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迫不及待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.25,1:25:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,直奔金库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight to the vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.16,1:25:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.33,1:25:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 瑞奇·鲍比 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, Ricky Bobby! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.27,1:25:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的要这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really gonna happen right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.67,1:25:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这样死在这个箱子里？真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna die here in this box? Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.27,1:25:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讽刺 一周前 我还想死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny. A week ago, I wanted to die,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.61,1:25:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后… 我就找回了活下去的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then… then I get my reason to live back,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.14,1:25:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果现在 我真的要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now, we're actually gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.31,1:25:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这哪里好笑了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.48,1:25:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我是说 在我脑子里挺好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, it was funnier in my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.52,1:26:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是… 你知道 那种诡异的好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… You know, it's peculiar funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.82,1:26:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别说了 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Uh-uh. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.69,1:26:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没辙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of options.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.26,1:26:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我不该那么刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I never should have been that horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.76,1:26:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐槽你的网站 服装还有标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your website and your costumes and the logo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.23,1:26:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 其实并不尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - It's not embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.83,1:26:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,“Wilder”里的“I”是根小魔杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the "I" in "Wilder"is a little magic wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.93,1:26:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道了 那… - 不尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. That's… - It's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.13,1:26:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 挺可爱的 挺迷人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - It's cute and it's charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.87,1:26:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 - 还有我… 我想你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's enough. - And I… I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.27,1:26:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道我平时不表现出来 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know I don't always show it, but, um…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.00,1:26:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对我真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do think the world of all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.84,1:26:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信我们要被活埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe we're getting buried alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.38,1:26:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这简直像西部片 - 等等 等等 活埋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, it's like a Western. - Wait, wait. Buried alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.85,1:26:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是… 魔术的老传统了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, like, an old magic tradition.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.38,1:26:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 谁表演过来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, who do we know who did that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.22,1:26:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔·舍克差点因此丧命 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Shirk nearly died doing that. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.99,1:26:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进了有机玻璃棺材然后被沙子埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got into a Plexiglas coffin and had it covered in sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.89,1:26:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但玻璃不是碎了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But didn't the Plexiglas break?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.53,1:26:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沙子湿了 - 沙子湿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The sand got wet. - The sand got wet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.33,1:26:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了 前一天晚上下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember now.It rained the night before.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.73,1:26:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 湿沙子比干沙子重 压碎了玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wet sand is heavier than dry. It broke the glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.00,1:26:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等 如果我们弄断那根管子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait.If we broke that pipe,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.97,1:26:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能弄湿沙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it would wet the sand,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.24,1:26:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它就会… 压垮箱子 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it'll…it'll break the box, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.20,1:26:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能… 如果我能缠住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could… If I could wrap something around it,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.14,1:26:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能借力把它弄断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be able to get some leverage.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.51,1:26:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.68,1:27:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里特 把皮带给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merritt, give me your belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.24,1:27:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 给你 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.Okay, you got it. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.18,1:27:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 好了 好了 - 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep, okay, okay. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.41,1:27:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 很好 很好 - 你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good, good. - You got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.82,1:27:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你行的 - 加油 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got this. - Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.02,1:27:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 耶 - 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! Yes!-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.69,1:27:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我 帮我 把我往下拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me! Pull me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.16,1:27:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 好 来 来 来 - 这是金属做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, okay. Yeah, yeah, yeah. - It's made up of metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.23,1:27:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮 漂亮 漂亮 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice, nice, nice, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.17,1:27:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边停车 你已经被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over.You have been surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.84,1:27:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是想停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to pull over,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.17,1:27:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我终于找到点手感了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm finally getting the hang of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.92,1:27:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩跟着他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.14,1:27:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上进入市场
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.09,1:27:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去另一边截住他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.64,1:27:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是世界上最棒的车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the greatest driver in the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.30,1:27:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.20,1:27:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.97,1:28:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.60,1:28:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄火 下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off the engine and exit the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.27,1:28:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got you surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.17,1:28:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands up and don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.78,1:28:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我是不是忘了打转向灯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Did I forget to use my blinker?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.45,1:28:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.05,1:28:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢各位 干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, gentlemen.Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.12,1:28:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对博斯科·勒罗伊发出了红色通缉令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had a red notice for one Bosco Leroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.95,1:28:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.66,1:28:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了 阿特拉斯会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, Atlas is gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.16,1:28:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 水进得太快了 - 玻璃打不破\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Water's coming in too fast. - And the glass won't break.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.96,1:28:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就为了一颗钻石 - 我们现在能用上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All this for a diamond. - We could use that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.97,1:28:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有钻石才能切割玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing cuts glass like a diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.63,1:28:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等 等等 亨利 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, whoa, whoa.Wait, Henley. Henley.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.90,1:28:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我能闭气八分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I can hold my breath for eight minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.94,1:28:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人能逃出去 那就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone can get us out of this, we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.40,1:29:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要穿越沙漠了 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're crossing into the desert, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.27,1:29:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙尘暴越来越大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dust storm is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.78,1:29:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.31,1:29:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,范德伯格女士的钻石被你和你的朋友偷了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Vanderberg's diamond that you and your friends stole?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.20,1:29:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢东西了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost something?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.92,1:29:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.66,1:30:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了 - 成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's working! - It's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.73,1:30:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody help!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.90,1:30:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮忙 - 搞起 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody help!-Let's do it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.32,1:30:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.90,1:30:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henley, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.13,1:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God!-Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.63,1:30:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们还得赶场演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got a show to catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.77,1:30:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望还不算太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we're not too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.40,1:30:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧？ - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.22,1:31:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}身份验证通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identity verified.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.24,1:31:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.91,1:31:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我想要的东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have what I want?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.31,1:31:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有我想要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.85,1:31:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the evidence?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.49,1:31:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.20,1:31:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.67,1:31:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我… 我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I… I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.97,1:31:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.04,1:31:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.45,1:32:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思 人们为了让…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite fascinating the things people do.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.32,1:32:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,某样东西或某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make something or someone…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.32,1:32:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.16,1:32:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.14,1:32:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教过你这个魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taught you that trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.74,1:32:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像父亲教你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like our father taught you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.51,1:32:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 15 年后 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, after 15 years, you're…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.51,1:32:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想毁了我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're trying to ruin me?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.85,1:32:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.08,1:32:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是整整 15 年\N{\fnArial\fs30}All 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.69,1:32:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你会在那辆车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you'd be in that car.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.35,1:32:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你听说我在里面时一定松了口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must have been relieved to hear I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.76,1:32:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们落水时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we hit the water,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.19,1:32:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解不开安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't unbuckle my seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.70,1:32:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈用最后一口气救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom freed me with her dying breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.80,1:32:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你只有喜爱 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing but fondness for you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.61,1:33:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我最后把你当弟弟对待一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me finally treat you like a brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.01,1:33:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.55,1:33:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都流着父亲的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father's blood is in both of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.95,1:33:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管他从未承认过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}though he'd never acknowledge mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.89,1:33:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道妈妈怎么求他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows Mother begged.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.29,1:33:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,耻辱地把我母亲逼进了坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the shame drove my mother to her grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.72,1:33:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就把我母亲也送进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you sent mine to hers!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.73,1:33:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.06,1:33:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.53,1:33:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它该归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.57,1:33:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.97,1:33:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.24,1:34:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,徒手接子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullet catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.67,1:34:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不可能 - 不 这只是魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's impossible. - No. Just magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.31,1:34:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.01,1:34:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.19,1:34:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.36,1:34:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.83,1:34:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.83,1:34:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚早些时候 阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earlier tonight, J. Daniel Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.66,1:34:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,承诺将“海洋之心”\N{\fnArial\fs30}promised to return the Heart Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.77,1:34:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,物归原主\N{\fnArial\fs30}to its rightful owner.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.60,1:34:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before we do that,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.14,1:34:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些介绍要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}some introductions are in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.31,1:34:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 让我们欢迎自然之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, let's say hello to the fierce force of nature,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.01,1:34:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,非凡的琼·鲁克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}the extraordinary June Rouclere!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.52,1:34:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, June!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.05,1:34:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 大家好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Hello, everyone. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.69,1:35:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.96,1:35:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是不屈不挠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And give it up for the indomitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.13,1:35:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,博斯科·勒罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosco Leroy!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.90,1:35:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣幸之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pleasure is ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.03,1:35:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.57,1:35:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N要是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, we could not have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.67,1:35:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最伟大的魔术师相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}any of this in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.84,1:35:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也做不到这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the help of the world's greatest magicians.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.51,1:35:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,四…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Four…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.68,1:35:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 是五骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, make that Five Horsemen!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.83,1:35:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.93,1:35:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.07,1:35:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我们娱乐过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we have entertained, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.10,1:35:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,震撼过世界各地的观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}dazzled audiences all over the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.01,1:35:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们从未参与过这样的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have never been part of a trick like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.38,1:35:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能会问\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you may be asking yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.08,1:35:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,“他们是怎么做到的？”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How did they pull this off?"
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.21,1:36:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 每个魔术师都需要一个助手 维罗妮卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, every magician needs an assistant. Veronika?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.12,1:36:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能认为维罗妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may think Veronika here,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.59,1:36:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为皮特·范德伯格的唯一继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Peter Vanderberg's sole heir,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.99,1:36:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这颗钻石的合法主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the rightful owner of this diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.16,1:36:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 反转来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.40,1:36:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特不止一个孩子 他有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter didn't have one child.He had two.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.97,1:36:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.37,1:36:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个孩子死里逃生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that other child cheated death.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.97,1:36:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}And landed in New York City.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.11,1:36:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里复仇成了他一生的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where vengeance became his life's work.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.88,1:36:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he would need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.58,1:36:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 找到威士忌了 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Found the scotch. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.28,1:36:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他招兵买马\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he recruited.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.75,1:36:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我什么时候停\N{\fnArial\fs30}when to stop, tell me when.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.82,1:36:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.92,1:36:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你的牌吗？ - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that your card? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.06,1:36:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧？想知道我是怎么做到的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? You want to know how I did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.79,1:36:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,引诱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enticed…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.89,1:36:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼络了他能找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lured some of the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.30,1:36:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最聪明的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}brilliant minds he could assemble,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.50,1:36:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为一场前所未有的魔术奠定基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}laying the groundwork for a trick unlike any other.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.24,1:36:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings us to tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.94,1:37:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这一切的幕后主脑欢呼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make some noise for the mastermind behind all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.24,1:37:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.81,1:37:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个幽灵… - 直到此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A ghost… - Until this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.82,1:37:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理·范德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Vanderberg!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.09,1:37:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.26,1:37:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我说过我很享受搞垮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I said I'd enjoy taking you down,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.30,1:37:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这比我预想的还要好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is more fun than I anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.23,1:37:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是个可悲又可怜的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are still a sad and pathetic man.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.97,1:37:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.27,1:37:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 等等 各位 稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hold on, everyone. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.14,1:37:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 永远都会是 - 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you never will be. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.60,1:37:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你们是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand how you pulled this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.97,1:37:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.14,1:37:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗妮卡似乎不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veronika doesn't seem to understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.54,1:37:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么落到这步田地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how she found herself in this position.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.54,1:37:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我们给她解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's explain it to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.78,1:37:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 最高明的魔术利用的就是思维定势\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, the finest magic preys on assumptions.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.29,1:37:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如以为接你的那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the car waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.75,1:37:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是送你来的那辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the same one that dropped you off.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.49,1:37:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.29,1:37:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为大自然的杰作就真的只是自然现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}That an act of Mother Nature is nothing but.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.34,1:38:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为沙漠里的金库\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that a vault in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.04,1:38:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不可能是障眼法\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't just smoke and mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.55,1:38:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为枪里装的不是空包弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That a gun isn't filled with blanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.72,1:38:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that an elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.06,1:38:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就真的只是在往下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}is just simply descending into earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.19,1:38:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想骗过欺诈大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to trick the master of deception,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.60,1:38:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得操纵她的现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to manipulate her reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.87,1:38:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为最后一个魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for our last trick,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.43,1:38:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们让维罗妮卡消失吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't we make Veronika disappear?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.67,1:38:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.87,1:38:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't win.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.34,1:38:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是范德伯格家族的人 - 她在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm the Vanderberg family!-There she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.84,1:38:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会儿就开始想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss you already.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.11,1:38:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终揭秘 - 听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Final reveal!-Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.18,1:38:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的维罗妮卡·范德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real Veronika Vanderberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.68,1:38:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,范德伯格家绝不会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vanderbergs do not lose!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.85,1:38:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界充满了幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is full of illusions.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.22,1:38:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中最大的幻觉就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the biggest is that this diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.35,1:38:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗钻石属于范德伯格家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}belongs to the Vanderbergs at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.19,1:38:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为我父亲唯一没进监狱的亲属\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my father's only un-incarcerated next of kin,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.76,1:39:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会确保我们的每一个非法买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure every one of our illicit buyers.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.06,1:39:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,都受到法律的制裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}faces legal repercussions.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.07,1:39:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会捐出我们所有的资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'll gift all our assets,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.10,1:39:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括“海洋之心”\N{\fnArial\fs30}including the Heart,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.97,1:39:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,捐给它们原本所属的南非社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the South African communities they came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.21,1:39:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便给在座的各位留点零花钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a few extra dollars left for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.75,1:39:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看骑士的表演总能让人满载而归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horsemen crowds always leave with deeper pockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.98,1:39:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 变相不错 - 名师出高徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice trick. - I learned from the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.12,1:39:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.29,1:39:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.39,1:39:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家的加入 谢谢所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for joining us, all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.16,1:39:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please remember,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.46,1:39:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论生活给你发了什么牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what cards life deals you,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.47,1:39:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都要学会创造属于自己的奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to learn to make your own magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.44,1:39:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.74,1:39:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是骑士 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}ALL: We are the Horsemen.Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.00,1:40:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\i0}骑士
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.97,1:40:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ {\c&HFFFFFF&}What Do We Ever Really Know？- Balu Brigada {\c&HFFDB00&}♪
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.38,1:40:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 阿里得了分 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Ali made a score ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.31,1:40:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 赚了百万还想要更多… ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Made a milli Wanted more… ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.61,1:40:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what do you want,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.32,1:40:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,石榴味还是波森莓味？\N{\fnArial\fs30}pomegranate or boysenberry?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.92,1:40:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我说我要喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I said I wanted a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.99,1:40:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.69,1:40:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids today.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.16,1:40:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm!-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.53,1:40:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.73,1:40:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要尝尝吗？ - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanna try? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.03,1:40:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是你掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.80,1:40:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的旧卡片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. My old card.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.24,1:40:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你想把它裱起来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case you wanna frame it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.67,1:40:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 没准真会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. I might.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.84,1:40:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你居然是范德伯格家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I still cannot believe you're a Vanderberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.18,1:40:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不敢信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither could she.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.58,1:40:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking I feel like.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.88,1:40:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该组个自己的团 姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should start our own group, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.52,1:41:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 女子魔术团？ - 对对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A girls magic group? - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.08,1:41:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 骑士女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - The Hor… Horsegirls.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.79,1:41:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 别叫那个 等等 女骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Not that. - Wait, Horsewomen.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.42,1:41:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要那个 - 骏马女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not that. - Ladies of the Horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.76,1:41:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定不叫那个 - 小马驹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It wouldn't be that. - Ponies!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.99,1:41:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真难听 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's really bad. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.06,1:41:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟你聊两句吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you real quick?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.49,1:41:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利和噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}HENLEY AND Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.93,1:41:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想打入“女骑士”内部啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to infiltrate the Horsewomen.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.93,1:41:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么… 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… what's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.43,1:41:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.70,1:41:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是… - 说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just… - Speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.94,1:41:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the matter with you?What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.44,1:41:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难开口 因为我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard because I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.71,1:41:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.28,1:41:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.41,1:41:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 呃 大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.38,1:41:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 都过来一下 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, come on over here, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.95,1:41:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？来吧 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.02,1:41:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 博斯科 能再拿点那个好吃的东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you grab some more of those delicious things, Bosco?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.79,1:41:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定会喜欢的这玩意 绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna love this stuff.It is slap.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.59,1:41:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 梅里特 别说了 - 真绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Merritt, please. - It slaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.69,1:41:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想说这东西不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I meant to say is it's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.23,1:41:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.30,1:41:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就由我来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and I will be the one to say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.60,1:41:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to miss you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.40,1:41:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也正这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.77,1:41:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.77,1:41:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, I love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.31,1:41:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 我们也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aw. - We love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.91,1:41:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.71,1:42:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真可爱 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Adorable. - Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.98,1:42:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜死人了 也爱我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very sweet. Even me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.38,1:42:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？你肯定喝高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You must be very drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.38,1:42:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.75,1:42:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 换个话题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Just talk about something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.12,1:42:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到刚才… 我们相亲相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to what…We all love each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.82,1:42:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱他 他爱她 碰拳 碰拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love him, he loves her.Fist bump. Fist bump.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.42,1:42:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩爱得更深\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys love each other more.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.79,1:42:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.16,1:42:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有客人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys expecting someone?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.39,1:42:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道我们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's supposed to know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.65,1:42:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁寄的？ - 没写\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's it from? - Doesn't say.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.75,1:42:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.15,1:42:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.45,1:42:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.63,1:42:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那是… 那是门上那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's the… that's the thing from the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.46,1:42:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 古堡里的 噢 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, from the chateau.Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.86,1:42:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 呃… 介意我再试一次吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, uh… You mind if I take another crack at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.27,1:42:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行 行 你来 - 好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, go for it. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.44,1:43:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回我能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can handle it this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.55,1:43:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.99,1:43:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.22,1:43:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.66,1:43:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是该在监狱里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's supposed to be in prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.13,1:43:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们在想什么 “他骗了我们”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking."He lied to us."
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.16,1:43:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我… 我没骗你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I… I didn't lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.56,1:43:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是让你们相信了非真相的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just led you to believe something that wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.07,1:43:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这都是为你们好 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was for your own good, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.17,1:43:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这谜题比你们想像的要深\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to this mystery than you realize.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.31,1:43:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最终结果就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the end result.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.51,1:43:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术骑士团重组了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that the Horsemen are back together again.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.71,1:43:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里很温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It warms my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.74,1:43:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你们三个冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for you three imposters,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.08,1:43:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆敢假装\N{\fnArial\fs30}brazenly pretending like.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.98,1:43:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们绝密组织的成员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're part of our top secret organization?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.32,1:43:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're gonna get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.99,1:43:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能全身而退 不用付出代价？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no consequences or repercussions?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.66,1:43:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.36,1:43:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you thought right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.83,1:44:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey!-Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.43,1:44:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入天眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to The Eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.90,1:44:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the rest of you,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.37,1:44:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为活干完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you thought your work was done.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.94,1:44:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再想想 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think again, team.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.34,1:44:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏才刚开场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.42,1:44:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术怎么玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the trick?
