Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.58,1:44:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ '{\c&HFFFFFF&}Cause I{\c&HFFDB00&}'{\c&HFFFFFF&}m so fly And I{\c&HFFDB00&}'{\c&HFFFFFF&}m so money {\c&HFFDB00&}♪
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.78,1:44:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ {\c&HFFFFFF&}Baby{\c&HFFDB00&}，{\c&HFFFFFF&} you can look But don{\c&HFFDB00&}'{\c&HFFFFFF&}t get touchy {\c&HFFDB00&}♪
